<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ugubutulo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ugub</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ugubutulo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ugubutulo wa Yohana</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ugubutulo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo wa Ugubutulo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kihitabu kya Ugubutulo ni kihitabu kya mwihu ku Laghilo Hyonu. Hilahila kiyandikilwi na mndumindumi Yohanakumachuva gha itisini na mhanu badili gha kuweleka kwa Kilisito 1:1. Hilahila Yohanaayandikili kihitabu kya Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na Yohanana lihamba lya 1 Yohanana 2 Yohanana 3 Yohana. Yohanakangi angumanyikana yiwa, “Mweni kupalwa na Yesu” Yohana 13:23. Ayandikili kihitabu kya Ugubutulo lipindi awelili kukihiwa kya Patimo kwaikiva haku avikilwi mkihungu kwa kuwoneka akitangasa Habali Maha gha Yesu Kilisito 1:9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukasini lwa Yohanakuyandika kihitabu haki kya Ububutulo ni kuwataya moyu wasoma ili wayendeleli kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito na kuwapegha litumaini kwaikiva lipindi lya kuhuya kwa Yesu lya pabehi 1:3, 22:7. Ayandikili kwa wakilisito wogha na nesu nesu kwa yala mapinga isaba gha wandu wamkwinilile Kilisito kusula gha 2, 3. Yohanaangutambulisa yiwa kila angukiyandika ni ulota kusula gha 1:3 na angutumila milandano mitangala yenikuwoneka kukihitabu kyogha ili kulongela vila avilolili. Kihitabu haki kingulandana kumahala mayaghani gha lilaghanu lya Dahile, nesu nesu kukihitabu kya Zekalia 6:1-8. Mapembi gha limgambo isaba na mabakuli isaba yangulandana na matovo Sapanga atumilili kuwatova wandu wa Wamisili kihitabu Kuhuma 7-9. Ugubutulo kingulongelela lipindi lya mwihu, lipindi liwela Yesu atewela msindi na wala wogha weni kumkwinila wateyendelela kulama pamonga na mweni machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Lihengu lya kihitabu haki ni kukulemesa na kikupegha litumaini yiwa Yesu anguhuya machuwa gha hinaa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha Mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Yohanaangutumbula kuyandika kihitabu haki kwa kulonga yiwa mweni kaghani na vila apokelili ulota hau 1: 1 - 20</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi kanguyegha ujumbi kuhuma kwa Yesu kwa yala mapinga isaba yamkwinila Kilisito 2:1-3:22</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu kangulongela vigubiku isaba 4:1-8:5 na mapembi gha limgambo isaba 8:6-11:19</para>
  <para style="io">Badili gha hagha Yohanakangulongela mdala kawela anguvingwa na linjoka kulungwa lyeni vimutu isaba 12:1-14:20</para>
  <para style="io">Hilahila kanguyandika mabakuli isaba gha lilaka lya Sapanga 15:1-16:21</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu Yohanakangulongela vila Sapanga anguwasinda wahakata ghaki haku kundumba 17:1-20:15</para>
  <para style="io">Mwihu kangulongela kundumba kuhyonu na mlima wogha mhyonu vila vitehika kumwihu 21:1-22:21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Hau ndiwa ugubutulo uwela Sapanga ampeghili Yesu Kilisito, lukani awalangihi watumikila ghaki hila mighalu yenikupalwa kuhumila machuwa gha hinaa. Hinu Kilisito amtumili mtumikila ghaki wa kundumba ili auyeghili ugubutulo hau kwa mtumikila ghaki Yohana. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Yohanaakalongela mighalu hyogha ailolile. Mighalu hai ni kunani gha uchakaka agubutulilwi na Yesu Kilisito, na hau ni lilando lya Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Sapanga atemhighila mundu mweni kusoma na yula mweni kuhyoghanila na mweni kuyitikila milando gha ulota hau kwaikiva iwela pabehi kutimila.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jambusu kwa mapinga isaba gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Nenga Yohananinguwayandikila lihamba hali mwenga mapinga isaba gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito haku Asia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Ninguwatakila umaha na kulikala kwa kuponga kuhuma kwa Sapanga yula kawela na yula awelili na yula atewela na kuhuma kwa Mipumulo isaba wenikuwela kuulongola gha kitamilo kyaki kya ukulu, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />na kuhuma kwa Yesu Kilisito, na yula machuwa hyogha angulongela ujunbi wa chakaka, mweni ndiwa wa mtumbulo kuhinduka na mweni ni kilongosi wa wankosi wogha wa kumlimawogha,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Yesu angutupala na kwa kihu kyaki katuvika pekesu kuhuma kuvihungu vya sambi tuwela navyu, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />akatughola twenga tuweli kuunkosi ghaki na watambika wa Sapanga, tumtumikili Sapanga mwenikuwela Tati ghaki. Ukulu na uwesa umghati ghaki machuwa hyogha bila mwihu! Hina.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Uloli! anguhika paghati gha mahindu kuhuma kundumba, na kila lisu litemlola, pamonga na wala wamuhomili kwa mgoha na misumali, na wandu wa makabila hyogha kumilima hyogha watelumbilila kunani ghaki, chakaka ndiwa itewela.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Bambu Sapanga mweni makakala hyogha angulongela nagha, “Nenga ndiwa Alufa na Omega ingumanisa ndiwa wa mtumbulo na wa mwihu, ni mwenikuwela, niwelili na nitehika nenga ni Sapanga.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohanaangulongela mighalu ailolile gha Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Nenga Yohana, mlongo wa mwenga kukumkwinila Kilisito, tungufumilala mahakilo pamonga kwaikiva gha Yesu na unkosi ghaki. Niwelili kukihiwa kya Patimo kwaikiva haku avikilwi mkihungu kwa kuwoneka na kosa lya kutangasa Habali Maha gha Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Lichuwa limonga lya ijumapili lya kumyupa Bambu, kunu nikiyupa ku Mpumulo wa Sapanga, kuhyetu ghangu nikayoghanila lilowi likilonga handa lya lipembi lya limgambo, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />likilonga, “Uyandiki kukihitabu hagha hyogha unguyalola, na hinu uyayeghi hagha kumalipinga isaba gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito haku, Efesu na Similina na Peligamo na Siatila na Salidi na Filadelifia na Lawodikia.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Hinu nikaghalambuka ili nimloli hayu mwenikulongela na nenga. Panihyukile nikalola vindu viisaba vya kuvikila mimbamba vyeni kugholwa kwa zahabu, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />kangi paghati ghati gha vila vindu vya kuvikila limbamba nimwonili mundu mlandanu wa Mwana wa Adamu, na mweni awelili kavala lihabiti litali na luhunga lwa zahabu uwopilwi kukitivi. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Mutu ghaki na hwila ghaki ziwelili mbulete pee, na mihu ghaki handa myengi gha lyoto. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Lwayo ghaki ni handa shaba yeni mng'anyimo nesu, na lilowi lyaki likawela handa mlindimo lya masi matangala yakihuluka kuhuma kulitumbi. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Kuliwoku lyaki lya kuliyila akolili ndondwa isaba na kumlomu ghaki kuhumili lipanga liwelili na ukalipa kunu na kunu. Na wusu ghaki uwelili ungung'anyima handa mhana wa lijuwa likalipa. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Hinu panimlola, nikaguwa kifulifuli kuulongolo gha maghulu ghaki handa mundu ahovile. Akavika liwoku lyaki lya kuliyila kunani gha nenga na kulongela, “Ukotoho kutila, nenga niwamtumbula na wa mwihu.” <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Nenga ni yula mweni ukomu! Niwelili nihova, ila uloli, hinaa ni mkomu machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na nenga ninguuwesa kukihu na kumambi. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Hinu, hinaa uyandiki mighalu hai ungulola, mighalu itehumila hinaa na hila hila yetehumila kuulongolo. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Nitekulongela zila ndondwa isaba uzilolili kukuliwoku lyangu lya kuliyila na nitekulongela vila vindu isaba vya zahabu vya kuvikila limbamba, ni ghani. Zila ndondwa isaba ni watumikila wa Sapanga wa kundumba weni kugholokela mapinga isaba gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito, na vila vindu viisaba vya zahabu vya kuvikila limbamba ni mapinga isaba gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kwa wakwinila wa ku Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Muyandikili mtumikila wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito weni kuwela haku Efesu nagha,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">“Hai ndiwa milandu anguilongela yula mweni kuzikola zila ndondwa isaba kukuliwoku lyaki lya kuliyila na kutyanga paghati ghati gha vindu viisaba vya zahabu vya kuvikila limbamba.” <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ningumanya matendu ghako hyogha, ningumanya kuyangala kwa wenga na ufumilifu ghako. Ningumanya yiwa unguwesa ng'ogha kuwafumilila wandu wahakata, na yiwa uwayesili wala weni kuilongela yiwa ni wandumindumi ila wawela nahang'ogha, na wenga ukamanya yiwa ni walongela uhwangi. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Wenga ni mfumilifu na uhakilwa kwaikiva gha nenga ila utenyukili ng'ogha. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ila nikali kuwela na mghalu mmonga lyeni kunighasa kwa wenga, uleka kunipala handa vila ugholile haku mtumbulo. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Hinu, ukumbwiki pala ugholile sambi, ughalambuki na uleki mahakata ghako na ughola handa ugholile haku mtumbulo, kihyetu na kughola nagha nenga nitehika kuhumisa kindu kyako kya kuvikila limbamba. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ila ningukusifila kunani gha mghalu mmonga, Wenga unguyahyomela ghala wanguyaghola Wanikolai handa vila nenga ninguwahyomela.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />“Mweni mapulikilo gha kuhyoghanilila, na ahyoghanile ghala yangulongelwa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kumapinga gha weni kumkwinila Kilisito!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">“Yula mweni kusinda nitempegha fwasi gha kulyegha matungula yeni kuhuma kulibiki lyeni ukomu uwelili kulitawa lya Sapanga.”<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kwa wakwinila wa ku Similina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Muyandikili mtumikila wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito weni kuwela haku Similina nagha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">“Hau ndiwa ujumbi wa yula wa mtumbula na wa mwihu, mwenikuwela nihovili na kuhinduka.” <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Ningumanya vila unguhakilika, ningumanya hilahila ukapuku ghako, ila wenga ni mnaisa, ningumanya vila wangukulonge maha ng'ogha wala wenikuikema ni Wayahudi ila ng'ogha Wayahudi wa chakaka bali weni ni lipinga lya Lihyukana. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Ukotoho kutila ghala mahakilo yatekukola. Ningukulongela hayu Lihyukana litewataya amonga gha mwenga mlighuta lya wawopwa ili kuwayesa na mwenga mtekolwa na lung'ai kwa lipindi lya machuwa ikumi. Uyendeleli kunikwinila na ujumili kuhova kwaikiva gha nenga, na nenga nitekupegha hupo gha ukomu.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Yula mweni mapulikilo gha kuhyoghanilila, hinu na ahyoghanili ghala Mpumulo anguyalongela mapinga gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">“Yeyosi mweni kufumilila hai, atehakilwa ng'ogha na kihu kya ipili.”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kwa wakwinila wa haku Peligamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Muyandikili mtumikila wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito weni kuwela haku Peligamo nagha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">“Hau ndiwa ujumbi kuhuma kwa yula mweni lipanga lyeni ukalipa mbandi zyogha ivili.” <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ningukumanya kula ungulikala, ndiwa kweni ulongosi wa Lihyukana. Ningumanya yiwa wenga ungunikwinila, wenga ukanila ng'ogha kulonga yiwa ungunikwinila nenga. Hata lipindi lila Antipasi mtumikila ghangu paatolilwi na kukomwa kumbwani mkulu wa nenga uvile Lihyukana angulongosa ila mkanila ng'ogha kulonga mngunikwinila. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Pamonga na hyogha, niwela na mighalu mayaghani kwa wenga. Amonga gha mwenga mngukovekela mavulo gha Balaamu, yula amlongelili Balaki awavuli wandu wa Waizilaeli wagholi sambi kwa kulyeghi mulyo iyeghilwi kwa ming'omung'omu handa litambiku na kughola ngongola. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Hilahila, paghati gha mwenga kuwela na wandu weni kukovekela mavulo gha Wanikolai. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Ila, ulonge sambi syako na kuleka. Paulema kuleka, nitehika kwa wenga njenji na kutovana na wandu hagha kwa lipanga lihuma pamlomu ghangu.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />“Yula mweni mapulukilo gha kuhyoghanila, hinu na ahyoghanili ghala Mpumulo anguwalongela mapinga gha weni kumkwinila Kilisito!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">“Yula mweni kusinda nitempegha mulyo kyeni kukemwa mana kyeni kuhighwa. Nitempegha hilahila liganga mbulete lyeni kuyandikwa lihina lyonu na hali kwahela mundu kalimanya ila yula mweni kulipokela.”<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kwa wakwinila wa ku Siatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Muyandikili mtumikila wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito weni kuwela haku Siatila nagha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">“Hau ndiwa ujumbi wa Mwana wa Sapanga, hayu mweni kunganyima mihu handa lyoto, na lwayo ghaki handa shaba ikeyilwi nesu.” <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ningumanya matendu ghako na upalu ghako, na kukwinila ghako, na utumikila ghako na ufumilifu ghako. Ningumanya yiwa hinaa ungughola maha kupiti kula mtumbulo. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ila, niwela na mghalu mmonga kwa wenga. Wenga ungumfumilila yula mdala wangumkema Yezebeli mwenikuikema mlota wa Sapanga, mwenikuvula na kubyodosa watumikila wa nenga wagholi ngongola na kulyegha mulyo iyeghwa litambiku kwa ming'omung'omu. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Nikampegha lipindi lya kuleka kughola mahakata, ila kalema kuleka kughola ngongola ghaki. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Hyoghanile hinaa nitempegha uvina mkulunga, weni utemghola asindwi kutandamka kukindanda, kangi niteyegha mahakilo makulungwa kwa wala weni kughola ngongola pamonga na mweni handa walema kuleka matendu ghao mahakata. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Kangi nitewakoma kwa uvina mhakata wala wandu weni kukovekela mavulo ghaki, ili mapinga hyogha gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito yatemanya yiwa nenga ndiwa mweni kulolesa mioyu na mawachilo gha kila mundu, na nenga nitemlamula kila mundu kukovekelana na vila kaghola.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />“Ila mwenga waghangi wenikuwela haku Siatila weni kukovekela ng'ogha mavulo ghaki Yezebeli na mlivula ng'ogha kila wangukimanya wavulwa ghaki kyeni kukemwa, ‘Mighalu gha mghati nesu gha Lihyukana’ ninguwalongela yiwa nitewapegha ng'ogha malaghilo ghangi matopeu muyakovikeli.” <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ila muyendeleli kuyitikila ujumbi wa nenga hula muwela nau. Muyendeleli kunikwinila mbaka panitehika. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Mundu yula mweni kusinda na kughola ghala Sapanga anguyapala mbaka mwihu, nitempegha ulongosi kwa wandu wa milima hyogha. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Atewalongosa kwa makakala kwa kukovekela malaghilo, na wala watekovekela ng'ogha atawametula metula handa vimbundi. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Nenga hilahila nipokela kulongosa haku kuhuma kwa Tati. Kangi nitempegha mundu hayu ndondwa gha malawila.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />“Mweni mapulikilo gha kuhyughanilila, hinu ahyoghanile ghala Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguwalongela mapinga yeni kumkwinila Kilisito!”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kwa wakwinila wa ku Salidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Muyandikili mtumikila wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito weni kuwela haku Salidi nagha,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">“Hagha ndiwa milandu ghaki Kilisito awelili na zila mpumulo isaba zya Sapanga na zila ndondwa isaba. Ninguyamanya matendu ghako, yiwa wandu wangulonga yiwa wenga ni mkomu ila uhova kala!” <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Uyimuki! Uvigangamalisi vila vimayaghani vyamaha kihighalili kwa vila hata hagha yawela pabehi na kuhova. Kwaikiva, mbaka hinaa niwonile matendu yaikila ng'ogha vila Sapanga ghangu angupala. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Ukumbwike, ghala uyahyoghanila na kuvulwa na kukwinila, uyayitikili na kuleka sambi na kumghalambukila Sapanga, handa pamteghola ng'ogha hagha nitekuhikila bila wenga kumanya, na wala utemanya ng'ogha lisaa nitekuhikila. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ila kuwela na wandu mayaghani kulipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito haku Salidi wandu weni kughola ng'ogha sambi. Weni wateyenda pamonga na nenga, wakiwela wavala nguu mbulete, kwaikiva ingupalwa waweli nagha. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Na wala watesinda atevaliswa nguu mbuleti handa weni, na nenga nitehumisa ng'ogha lihina lyaki kukihitabu kya ukomu ila nitemtangasa kuulongolo gha Tati ghangu na kuulongolo gha watumikila ghaki wa kundumba yiwa ni wanenga.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Yula mweni mapulukilo gha kuyughanila, na ahyoghanili ghala Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguwalongela mapinga gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kwa wakwinila wa ku Filadelifia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Muyandikili mtumikila wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito weni kuwela haku Filadelifia nagha,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">“Hagha ndiwa angulonga mweni kawela mbulete pee na mchakaka, mwenikuwela niwela na funguu gha Daudi. Na kila angukiwoposola kwahela mweni kuwesa kukiwopa, na kila angukiwoposola kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kukiwopa.” <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ningumanya mighalu ghako hyogha! Hinaa, niwoposola mlyango kuulongolo ghako wenikuwela kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kutata, ningumanya yiwa pamonga na yiwa uwela ng'ogha na makakala nesu, ila uliyitikila lilando lyangu wala ulikanila ng'ogha kuulongolo gha wandu. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Nitewaghola wala wandu wa lipinga lya Lihyukana, wandu weni kuilongela yiwa ni Wayahudi, uchakaka ni wahwangi. Nitewaghola wahiki kwa wenga na watekutundamila manung'una kuulongolo ghako, na wamanyi yiwa ningukupala. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Nenga nikulongela kuwela mfumilili, na wenga ukaniyitikila nenga, hinu nitekugholokela lipindi lya lung'ai palihika wandu wa mlima wogha ili kuwesa kuwayesa. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Ninguhika kwa wenga kwa kubwitukila! Ukoli nesu kila uwela nachu, ili pakotoho kuwela na mundu wa kukupokola hupo ghako gha kusinda. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Atesinda nitemghola aweli mghomba mu Lighuta lya Sapanga wa nenga, na atehuma ng'ogha hamu. Kangi niteyandika kunani ghao lihina lya Sapanga wanenga na lihina lya mbwani wa Sapanga wanenga, ingumanisa Yelusalemu hyonu, mbwani uvile utesuluka kuhuma kunani kundumba kwa Sapanga wanenga. Kangi niteyandika lihina lyangu lahyonu kunani ghao.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Mweni mapulikilo gha kuhyoghanila, hinu, na ayahyoghanile yala Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguwalongela mapinga gha wandu weni wamkwinila Kilisito.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi kwa wakwinila wa ku Lawodikia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Muyandikili mtumikila wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito weni kuwela haku lawodikia nagha,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">“Hagha ndiwa milandu ghaki mweni kukemwa Hina, anguilonga kwa uchakaka yala awonili na kuhyoghanila na uvile ni mchakaka. Hayu mweni kuwela mtumbulo kya viumbi vyogha avilumbili Sapanga.” <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ninguyamanya matendu ghako hyogha. Ningumanya yiwa wenga uwela ng'ogha handa mahihimo wala ng'ogha makalipa. Mbaha ungaliwela handa mahihimo au makalipa. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ila kwaikiva wenga kwa mhutuhutu ng'ogha mhihimo wala makalipa nenga nitekulukula. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Wenga ulongile, “Nenga ni naisa, nijivikila hindu ngoo, wala nipala ng'ogha kindu chochosi.” Ila ungumanya ng'ogha yiwa wenga uwela ng'ogha na kindu na ungupalwa kuwonelwa luhungu na mkapuku na ungali mihu na kangi mwenekuwela ngelengi. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Kwa nagha ningukulongela uhemeli kuhuma kwa nenga zahabu yeni kuwofulwa kwa lyoto ili upati kuwela mnaisa, na nguu mbulete ili uvali na kuhumisa honi gha kukotoho kuwela na nguu, na uhemeli mtela wa mihu upakali kumihu ghako upati kulola kangi. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Nenga ndiwa mweni kuwakalipila na kuwanyokola wogha ninguwapala. Hinu uyangali kuleka sambi na kumhyukila Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Uyughanili, Nenga ningugholoka na kukuwa mlyango na kukema. Mundu pakayughanila lilowi lyangu na kuwoposola mlyango, niteyingila mlighuta lyaki na kulyegha mulyo pamonga na mweni, na mweni atelyegha pamonga na nenga. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Msindi nitempegha fwasi kutama pamonga nanenga ku kitamilo kyangu kya kinkosi. Handa vila nenga nisindili nikatama pamonga na Tati ghangu kukitamilo kyaki lya kinkosi.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“Mweni awelili na mpulikilo lya kuyughanila, na ahyoghanile yala yawelili Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguwalongela wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito.”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Kumyupa Sapanga Kundumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Badili gha hagha nilolili niwonili mlyango uwela lipala kundumba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Na lila lilowi niliyughanilili pala utumbulo iwelili handa lilowi lya lipembi lya lamgambo, ikalonga, “Uhiki kunu kunani, na nenga nitekulangiha mighalu yatehumila kuulongolu.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Lipindi lilalila Mpumulo wa Sapanga akanighola kulola na kuhyoghanila vindu vitangala, nikalola kitamilo kya kinkosi haku kundumba kitamilwi na mmonga. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Hayu atamili kunani ghaki awelili handa lidini lya galama lya yasipi na lidini lya akiki. Hilahila upindi wa ndonya uwelili ungung'anyima handa lidini lya galama lya sumalidi na ukitindila kitamilo kya kinkosi pandi zyogha. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kuwelili na utindilu wa vitamilu viisilini na njechi kukitindila kitamilo kya kinkosi, na kunani gha vitamilu havi wawelili watamili wagogolo waisilini na njechi wawelili wavalila nguu mbulete na likokoma lya zahabu kumutu ghao. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Ku kila kitamilo kya kinkosi pawelili panguhuma lumuli na mlindimu wa ladi na lilowi. Kuulongolu gha kila kitamilo kya kinkosi, pawelili na limbamba isaba siwelili sikiyaka. Hasi ndiwa Mpumulo isaba zya Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Kangi kuulongolu gha kitamilo kya kinkosi pawelili na kindu kiwonekanili handa bahali gha kiou, ingung'anyima handa liganga lingung'anyima nesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Ku pandi zyogha zya kila kitamila kya kinkosi, kuwelili na viumbi weni ukomu wanjechi. Viumbi hagha wawelili wamema mihu kuulongolo na kuhyetu. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Kiumbi wa utumbula awelili handa himba, na waivili awelili handa ng'ombi likambaku na waitatu awelili na wusu handa wusu gha mundu, na wanjechi awelili handa ngwasi mweni kuhuluka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Kila mmonga wa hagha viumbi weni ukomu wanjechi, awelili na mbapatilu isita na kumema mihu pandi zyogha, mbaka pahi gha mbapatilu. Uhiku na pamuhi wakeleka ng'ogha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">“Bambu, Sapanga kana makakala zyogha, mweni katimila nesunesu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">Mweni ni mmaha nesu, Awelili, kawela na atehika.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Lipindi lyogha viumbi wala weni ukomu mnjechi pawawelili wangumyinula na kumtundamila na kumshukwile mweni atamili kukila kitamilo kyaki kya kinkosi, avile mkomu machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />wala wagogolu waisilini na njechi huiguwisa kifulifuli kuulongolu gha hayu atamili ku kitamilo kya kinkosi na kumyupa hayu mweni angulama machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na huvika mikokoma ghao kuulongolu gha kitamilo kya kinkosi, wakilonga,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Bambu watwenga na Sapanga wa twenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">wenga upalili kupokela ukulu na utundamilu na uweso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">kwaikiva wenga ndiwa uviumbili vindu vyogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">na kwa kupala kwa wenga vila vilumbilwi vikawela.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Kihitabu na Mwanakondolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Hinu nikiwonili kihitabu kuliwoku lya kuliyila wa yula atamili kukitamilo kya kinkosi, nakyeni kiwelili kiyandikwa mghati na panji na kitaywa vibandiku viisaba vyeni muuli.<figure style="fig" file="03 Seals.jpg" size="col" ref="5:1">Kihitabu kyeni muuli isaba</figure> <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Kangi nikalola mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mweni makakala akilonga kwa lilowi likulunga, “Ghani mweni sifwa kutwenyula havi vibandiku na kukigubutula kihitabu haki?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ila pawelili kwahela na mundu yoyosi kundumba, wala mumlimawogha, wala pai kumambi, awesili kukigubutula haki kihitabu au kulola mghati. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Hinu nenga nikalila nesu kwaikiva kawoneka ng'ogha mundu yoyosi mweni sifwa gha kukigubutula, au kulola mghati. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Hinu mmonga paghati gha wala wagogolo akanilongela, “Ukotoho kulila! Uloli, himba lya likabila lya Yudasi, wa uwelekwa wa nkosi Daudi, amesinda. Mweni ndiwa anguwesa kutwenyula vila vibandiku viisaba na kukigubutula haki kihitabu.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Hinu nikalola pala paghati gha kitamilo kya kinkosi mwanakondolu kagholoka, akitindilwa kila upandi na wala viumbi wakomu wanjechi, na wala wagogolu. Hayu mwanakondolu awonekanili handa kahinjwa. Awelili na pembi isaba na mihu isaba navyeni ni mpumulo isaba zya Sapanga ziwelili ziyeghwa kila mahala mumlimawogha. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Mwanakondolu akayenda, akakitola kila kihitabu kuhuma kukuliwoku lya kuliyila lya yula atamili kukitamilo kya kinkosi. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Pala hela patolili kila kihitabu, wala viumbi weni ukomu njechi pamonga na wala wagogolu waisilini na njechi waguwili kifulifuli kuulongolu gha mwanakondolu. Kila mmonga awelili na ligombogombo, na bakuli sya zahabu zimemili ubani, ukiva ni mayupo gha wandu wa Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Naweni, wakayimba uwimbu hau mhyonu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">“Wenga ungusifwa gha kukitola kila kihitabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">na kusitwenyula vibandiku vyaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">Kwaikiva wenga uhinjwa na kwa mwahi ghako umhemelela Sapanga watwenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">wandu kuhuma kila likabila na vila wangulonga na ukolu na mlima.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Wenga uwaghola wandu waweli unkosi wa watambika wa kumtumikila Sapanga wa twenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:10">na watewalongosa wandu wogha kumlimawogha.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Hinu panilolili kangi, nikayughanila lilowi lya watumikila wa kundumba watangala nesu, uvalangi ghao iwelili ikumi ielufu mwanja ikumi ielufu na maelufu mwanja ielufu. Wawelili wakigholoka kutindila kila kitamilo kya kinkosi, pamonga na wala viumbi weni ukomu wanjechi na wala wagogolu waisilini na njechi, . <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Naweni wakayimba kwa lilowi likulunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">“Wakilonga mwanakondolu, mweni ahinjilwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">kana sifwa gha kupokela uwesa, na unaisa na luhala na makakala na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">utundamilu na ukulu na kuyinulwa.” <verse eid="REV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Hinu nikayughanila kila kiumbi kundumba na mumlimawogha, na pai kumambi na mbahali na fyogha viwelili mghati ghaki vikilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">“Kuyinulwa na utundamilu na ukulu na uwesa ni fyaki mweni atamili kukila kitamilo kya kinkosi na kwa mwanakondolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.” <verse eid="REV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Na wala viumbi weni ukomu wanjechi wakalonga, “Hina!” Na wala wagogolu waisilini na njechi wakaguwa kifulifuli wakayupa.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Mwanakondolu angutwenyula vibandiku vyeni muuli viisaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Hinu, nimuwonili mwanakondolu kangutwenyula kibandiku kimonga paghati gha vila vibandiku viisaba. Nikayughanila mmonga wa wala viumbi weni ukomu wanjechi akilonga kwa lilowi likulunga handa gha mlindimu wa ladi, “Uhiki!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Nenga nilolili kuulongolu ghangu awelili falasi mbulete. Mweni amlongosili falasi yula awelili na upindi, namweni apeghilwi likokoma lya usindi. Hinu akahuma akiwela msindi, ili ayendelele kusinda.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Hinu, Mwanakondolu akatwenyula kila kibandiku kya ivili. Nikamyughanila yula kiumbi mghangi wa ivili mweni ukomu akilonga, “Uhiki!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Ndiwa akahumila falasi mghangi mkeli nesu. Yula mweni kumlongosa falasi yula apeghilwi uweso wa kuhumisa kuponga kwa wandu wa mlima wogha mweni apeghilwi lipanga likulungwa na kuwaghola wandu wakomani, .<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Hinu Mwana kondolu akatwenyula kila kibandiku kya itatu. Nikamyughanila yula mundu mghangi wa itatu mweni ukomu akilonga, “Uhiki!” Nikalola na nikawona falasi mghangi mtitu. Mweni amlongosili falasi yula awelili na mzani wa kupimila haku na haku mmawoku ghaki. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Nikayughanila kindu handa lilowi likihuma kwa wala viumbi weni ukomu wanjechi. Na lyeni likilonga, “kimbu yimu gha ukowa wa nganu kwa msahala wa lichuwa limonga wa mundu, na kimbu itatu zya shahili kwa msahala wa lichuwa limonga lya mundu. Ila ukotoho kuyalamisa mahuta gha mzaituni wala difwai!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Hinu, Mwanakondolu akatwenyula kibandiku kya njechi. Nikamyughanila yula kiumbi mweni mkomu wa njechi akilonga, “Uhiki!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Panilolesa nikamlola falasi mweni langi gha lifu na yula mweni kumkwela awelile kihu na mweni kumambi awelile akimkovekela kuhyetu ghaki. Naweni wapeghilwi uweso kunani gha lobo gha mlima wogha wawakomi wandu kwa ngondo na kwa njala ngulu na kwa uvina makalipa na kwa mikokolo mikalipa.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Hinu, Mwanakondolu akatwenyula kibandiku kya itano. Pala pahi pakihanja kya matambiku gha kulunguswa nikalola mipumulo gha wandu wahinjilwi kwaikiva gha lilando lya Sapanga na kwaikiva gha ghala wawelile wakiyalongela. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Wakalila kwa lilowi likulunga, “Wenga Bambu mkulu, Sapanga wa weka na mghola ghamaha, mbaka ligha utelindila kuwatosa na kuwahuyisila wandu weni kutama kumlimawogha kwa kutukoma?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Wakapeghwa kila mmonga nguu mbulete yenikuwela ndali, wakalongelwa wayendeleli kulindila kwa lipindi lihupi, mbaka pautimila utangala wa watumikila wayau wenikuwela watekomwa handa weni.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Mwanakondolu paakitwenyula kila kibandiku kya isita. Pakahumila mhihimilo mkulu kumlima, na lijuwa likawela lititu handa nguu lya ligunila ligholilwi kwa mapuku gha mbui, na mwehi wogha ukawela mkeli handa mwahi. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Ndondwa zya kundumba sikaguwa kunani gha mlima handa matungula gha libiki lya mkuyu yeni vinyalila yenikuguwa lipindi libiki lyaki lingutikaniswa na liyegha likalipa. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Kunani ukahuka handa vila likalatasi linyengwa, mitumbi hyogha na visiwa vyogha vighuswili paviwelili. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Na wankosi kumlimawogha na wakulu na watovangondo wakulu na wanaisa na weni makakala na kila muhusutu na mwenikuwela ng'ogha muhusutu, wakalihigha kumbangu na kuhyetu gha miganga mikulunga. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Wakailongela hila mitumbi na hila miganga mikulunga, “Mtuguwili, mtuhighi tukotoho kuwoneka na hayu mweni kulikala kukitamilo kya kinkosi na utuhighi kutali gha lilaka lya Mwanakondolu, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />kwaikiva lichuwa lihakata lya lilaka lya Sapanga na lya Mwanakondolu lihika, kwa nagha ni ghani mwenikuwesa kufumilila?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Wandu wa Sapanga wanguvikwa kilangihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Badili gha hagha nikawalola watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wanjechi wagholoka mbandi njechi zya mlima wogha, wangukingama liyegha likotoho kuyenda mbandi zyogha njechi zya kumlimawogha au kubahali au kumibiki. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Hinu, nikamlola mtumikila mghangi wa kundumba wa Sapanga akikwela kunani kuhuma kula linguhumila lijuwa, hayu awelile kakola muuli wa Sapanga mweni ukomu akawakema kwa lilowi likulunga wala watumikila wanjechi wa kundumba wa Sapanga weni kulongelwa wayalamisi mlima na bahali akilonga, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Mkotoho kuyalamisa mlima, wala bahali wala mibiki, mbaka tuyomoli kuwataya muuli watumikila wa Sapanga wa twenga kukibungi kya wuso.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Hinu, nikahyughanila uvalangi gha wala wavikilwi vilangihi hai, wandu laki imonga na ialobaini na njechi ielufu wa kabila zyogha zya Izilaeli. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Wandu wavikilwi muuli kuhuma likabila lya Yudasi wawelile ielufu ikumi na ivili, na kuhuma kulikabila lya Lubeni wawelile ielufu ikumi na ivili na kuhuma kulikabila lya Gadi wawelile ielufu ikumi na ivili. <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Kuhuma kulikabila lya Asheli wawelile ielufu ikumi na ivili, kuhuma kulikabila lya Nafutali wawelile ielufu ikumi na ivili, kuhuma kulikabila lya Manase wawelile ielufu ikumi na ivili. <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Kuhuma kulikabila lya Simioni, wawelili ielufu ikumi na ivili, na kuhuma likabila lya Lawi wawelili ielufu ikumi na ivili, na kuhuma likabila lya Isakali wawelili ielufu ikumi na ivili. <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Kuhuma likabila lya Zebuloni wawelili ielufu ikumi na ivili, na kuhuma likabila lya Yosefu, wawelili ielufu ikumi na ivili, na kuhuma likabila lya Benjamini wawelili ielufu ikumi na ivili.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipinga likulunga lya wandu wavalili nguu mbulete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Hinu, nikalola pala kuulongolu ghangu lipinga likulunga nesu lya wandu liwesa ng'ogha kuvalangwa na mundu yeyosi, kuhuma kila mlima, na kila likabila, na kila ukolu, na kila luga, wagholoka kuulongolu gha kila kitamilo kya kinkosi na kuulongolu gha Mwanakondolu. Wawelili wavala nguu mbulete na wawela wakola miputila gha mitendi, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Wakatova lilowi wakilonga, “Ulokola wa twenga unguhuma kwa Sapanga wa twenga mweni kutama kukitamilo kya kinkosi, na kuhuma kwa Mwanakondolu” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Watumikila wogha wa kundumba wakagholoka kukitindila kitamilo kya kinkosi, wagogolo isilini na njechi na wala viumbi wakomu wanjechi. Wakaguwa kifulifuli kuulongolo gha kitamilo kya kinkosi na kumyupa Sapanga, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />wakilonga, “Hina! Kuyinulwa, na ukulu, na luhala, na kushukwile, na utundamilu, na uweso na makakala viweli kwa Sapanga wa twenga, machuva hyogha bila mwihu! Hina!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Hinu mmonga wa wala wagogolo waisilini na njechi akanikonya, “Ni ghani hagha weni kuvala nguu mbulete, na weni wahumili kugha?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Nenga nikamyanga, “Mkulu nenga nimanya ng'ogha, wenga ungumanya ni akina ghani hagha.” Namweni akanilongela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">“Hagha ni wala wahumili kulila lung'ahi likulunga, naweni waghululili nguu zyau kumwahi gha Mwanakondolu na kughola lihabiti zyao kuwela mbulete nesu,” <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Hagha unguwalola, “Kuulongolo gha kitamilo kya kinkosi kya Sapanga. Wangumtumikila Sapanga uhiku na pamuhi kulighuta lyaki na mweni mwenikulikala kukitamilo kya kinkosi atewagubika kwa kuwela naweni kwa vila kawela pamonga na weni na kuwagholokela. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Watewela ng'ogha na njala wala kuyumililwa kangi. Wala lijuwa wala kifukengi likalipa lya kuwalungusa, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />kwaikiva Mwanakondolu mwenikuwela kukitamilo kya kinkosi atewela mhungaji wau, na mweni atewalongosa kuuhimbuki gha masi gha ukomu. Na Sapanga atepyate masosi ghao hyogha.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwanakondolu angutwenyula kibandiku kya isaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Hinu Mwanakondolu paakitwenyula kila kibandiku kya isaba, kukawela kunyamala jii kundumba kwa lipindi lya nusu lisaa. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Hinu, nikawalola wala watumikila isaba wa kundumba wangugholoka kuulongolu gha Sapanga, na weni wapeghilwi mipembi gha limgambo isaba.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Mtumikila mghangi wa kundumba wa Sapanga awelili na kiyonjo kya zahaba, akahika na kugholoka kuulongolu gha kihanja kya kulungusila ubani. Na mweni akapeghwa ubani utangala ayeghi handa litambiku pamonga na mayupo gha wandu wogha wa Sapanga kunani gha kihanja kya zahabu, kyeni kuwela kuulongolu gha kitamilo kya kinkosi kya Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Hula lyohi lya ubani pamonga na yala mayupo gha wandu wa Sapanga, vikakwela kunani kuulongolu gha Sapanga, kuhuma mumawoko gha yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Na yula mtumikila wa kundumba akakitola kila kiyonjo, akakimemesa lyoto lya kihanja, akalidanga lyoto kunani gha mlima wogha, kukawela lilowi lya ladi na lumuli na mhihimo wa mlima.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipembi gha limgambo isaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Hinu, wala watumikila isaba wa kundumba kwa Sapanga wakaliyandala kupulila hila mipembi lya limgambo zyao.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Mtumikila wa mtumbulo akapulila lipembi lya limgambo, ikahumila ndonya gha miganga yenikuhanganyika na lyoto pamonga na mwahi, vikadangwa kwa likakala kunani gha mlima wogha na selusi gha mlima wogha ikayalamika, selusi gha mibiki ikayalamika na manyahi hyogha mavihi yakayalamika.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Na mtumikila wa ivili akalipulila lipembi lya limgambo. Na kindu handa litumbi likulunga lyeni kuyaka lyoto kikataghwa mbahali. Selusi imonga kya bahali ikawela mwahi, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />selusi imonga gha viumbi wa mbahali vikahova, na Selusi imonga gha whatu ngulungwa sikakologhanyiwa.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Mtumikila wa itatu akapulila lipembi lya limgambo, na ndondwa ngulu ikawela ikiyaka handa lyoto, ikaguwa kuhuma kunani, ikaguwila Selusi gha milweni na kuuhimbuhimbu zya masi. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Ndondwa hai ingukemwa “lusungu”. selusi gha masi yakawela na lusungu na wandu watangala wakahova kwaikiva gha masi hagha kuwela na lusungu.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Mtumikila wa injechi na mweni akapulila lipembi lya limgambo lyaki. Ndiwa selusi imonga gha lijua, na selusi imonga gha mwehi na selusi imonga gha ndondwa, vikatovwa, vikawela na lwisa na selusi imonga gha pamuhi ikawela ng'ogha na mhana na selusi imonga gha uhiku ikawela ng'ogha na mhana.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Hinu, nikalola ngwasi mkulungwa akighuluka kunani nesu. Nikayughanila akitova lilowi akilonga, “Mtepokela lung'ai, mtepokela lung'ai, mtepokela lung'ai yatewahikila wala wangulikala mumlimawogha lipindi watumikila wa itatu wa kundumba wa Sapanga wahighalili watepulila mipembi gha limgambo lyau!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Mtumikila wa mhanuo na mweni akapulila lipembi lya limgambo. Na nenga nikalola ndondwa iguwili pahi gha mlima kuhuma kundumba. Na yeni ipeghilwi ufunguu wa liwumba litali liyendelela. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ndondwa hai ikawopola liwumba hali lya kumambi, kukahumila lyohi kuhuma kulitanuli likulunga nesu. Lijua na kunani vikatawa lwisa kwa lyohi hali lyeni kuhuma kumambi. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Hinu kulyohi lila wakahuma nzige, wakalandala kumlimawogha, wakapeghwa makakala gha kuluma handa inge. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Wakalongelwa wakotoho kuyalamisa manyahi gha mlima wala mahamba wala libiki lolosi, ila wawayalamisi wala weni kuvikwa ng'ogha muuli wa Sapanga kukivungi kya wuso. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Nzige wala walekeselwa ng'ogha kuwakoma wandu, ila kuwahakila hela kwa lipindi lya miehi mhano. Lusungu yatewakola wala weni kulumwa na hagha nzige ni handa kulumwa na inge. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Lipindi hali wandu watehakula kihu, ila watekilola ng'ogha, watewela na luhujulu lwa kuhova ila kihu kitewatua.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Nzige wala wawonekanili handa falasi wenikuyandalwa kwa ngondu. Kumutu wavwalile hindu iwonekanili handa likokoma lya zahabu. Wuso ghao uwonekanili handa wuso wa mundu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Hwila zyau ziwelili handa hwila zya wadala, na malino ghao yawelile handa malino gha himba. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Vitivi vyau viwelili vigubikwa vindu handa lipangalala lya lyuma. Lilowi lya mbapatilu ghao liwelile handa lilowi lya mwanja wa mbutuka zya falasi watangala weni kutuwila kungondu. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Wawelili na mikila na mihomi handa inge, na kwa mikila hila, wawelili na makakala gha kuwaluma wandu kwa lipindi lya miehi mhano. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Kangi wawela na nkosi mweni kuwalongosa, na mweni ndiwa mtumikila wa kumambi, lihina lyaki kwa Kiebulania ni Abadoni, na kwa Kigiliki ni Apolioni, ikimaanisa mweni kuyalamisa.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Lung'ai ngulu lwa mtumbulo lupita kala, yambila maghangi maivili yanguhika.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Yapitili hagha mtumikila wa isita akapulila lipembi lya limgambo. Na nenga nikahyoghanila lilowi limonga kuhuma kupembi zinjechi zya kihanja kya zahabu kya kulungusila ubani lyeni kuwela kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Lilowi hali likamlongela hayu mtumikila wa isita wa Sapanga mweni lipembi lya limgambo, “Uwawoposeleli watumikila wanjechi weni kuwopwa kweni lweni mkulunga Fulati!” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Mweni akawawoposelela watumikila hagha wanjechi weni kuwela wayandalwa kwaikiva gha lisaa lila lya lichuwa lya mwei hula wa lichuva lilalila, kukoma selusi imonga gha wandu wogha. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Nikahyoghanila utangala wa watovangondo wawakwelili falasi wawelili imilioni imia ivili. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Havi ndiwa niwalola hagha falasi na wakwela falasi kumawonu, wakwela falasi wawelile na mapangalala kuvitivi yenikuwela lyotu weka, yeni langi ngeli nesu na buluu na njanu handa langi gha baluti. Nikalola mutu gha falasi uwelili handa wa himba, na kumilomu ghao kuwelili kukihuma lyoto na lyohi na madini gha kibaliti. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Selusi gha wandu wahovili kwa matovo hagha maitatu, kwa lyoto na lyohi na madini gha baluti vyenikuhuma kumilomu gha wala falasi, <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />kwa vila makakala gha hagha falasi yawelili kumilomu ghao na kumikila ghao. Mikila ghao ilandanili na njoka na iwelili na mutu, na weni watumilili hila kuwahakila wandu.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Wandu waghangi wahighalili wenikuwela wakomilwi ng'ogha na matovo yala, wamyukila ng'ogha Sapanga na waleka ng'ogha sambi bali wayendelelile kutumainila vindu wavigholile kwa mawoko ghao ili kuviyupila. Walekili ng'ogha kuyupa mahoka na ming'omung'omu yenikuhongolwa kwa zahabu na feza na shaba na maganga na mibiki na vindu vyenikuwesa ng'ogha kulola wala kuhyoghanila wala kutyanga. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Wandu wala wamyukila ng'ogha Sapanga na waleka ng'ogha sambi zyao gha kukoma na uhawi na ngongola, na wihi.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga na kihitabu kinung'una</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Hinu, nikamlola mtumikilia mghangi wa kundumba mweni makakala akihuluka kuhuma kundumba. Awelili kagubikwa lihindu, na upindi wa ndonya kumutu ghaki. Wusu ghaki ung'anyikili handa lijuwa, na maghulu ghaki yawelile handa mighomba zya lyoto. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Mumawuko ghaki awelile kakola kihitabu kinung'una kyeni kuwela kigubutulwa. Akavika lighulu lyaki lya mbandi gha kuliyila kunani gha bahali na lighulu lya shotu kumlima, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />na akatova lilowi likulunga handa himba mweni kulindima. Paawelili akitova lilowi, malowi zya ladi isaba yakahyoghanika kwa lindimu. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Badili gha ladi isaba kuhumisa mlindimu, nenga nikapala kutumbula kuyandika, ila nikahyoghanila lilowi kuhuma kundumba, “Ukotoho kuyandika yala uhyoghanilile kuhuma kuladi isaba ila uyaleki yakotoho kumanyikana!”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Hinu, nikamlola yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mweni kugholoka kunani gha bahali na kumlima akiyinula liwoku lyaki kuyendela kundumba, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />akalapa kwa Sapanga mweni kulikala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, Sapanga mwenikulumba kundumba na vindu vyogha vyenikuwela, bahali na vyogha vyenikuwela mbahali, mlima wogha na vyogha vyenikuwela kumlimawogha. Akalonga, “Lipindi lya kuyendelela kulindila lipela kala! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ila lipindi yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga paatepulila lilowi lya lipembi lya limgambo lyaki, Sapanga atetimilisa mghalu ghaki wa kifisu handa vila awalongilile walota ghaki wamtumikilile.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Na, yila lilowi niwelili niiyughanila kuhuma kundumba kula kuhyetu ikilonga na nenga kangi. “Uyendi ukaniyegheli kila kihitabu kigubutulilwi, kyeni kukolwa na yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mweni kugholoka kunani gha bahali na kumlima.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Hinu, Nikamyendela yula mtumikila wa kundumba, nikamluwa anipeghi kila kihitabu kinung'una. Na mweni akanilongela, “Ukitoli, ukilyeghi. Mumlomu ghako kitewela kinogha handa bhuche, ila mumtima ghako kitewela kikalipa.” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Na nenga nikakitola kihitabu haki kinung'una kuhuma mumawoku gha yula mtumikila wa kundummba, nikakilyegha. Na kyeni kiwelili kinogha mumlomo ghangu handa bhuche, ila panikimila kikawela kikalipa mumtima ghangu. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Hinu, nikalongelwa “Ungupalwa kuyendelela kuwalongela wandu kila kitehumila kwa makabila matangala, wa milima na luga na wankosi!”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Watumikila waivili weni kulonga ujumbi wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Hinu, nipeghilwi lidengi lyeni kuwela handa libiki lya kupimila, nikalongelwa, “Uyinuki, ukapimi Lighuta lya Sapanga, na kihanja kya kutumisila mafumba na kuwavalanga wandu weni kuyupa mghati gha Lighuta lya Sapanga hali. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ila ukotoho kupima lyugha lya panji gha Lighuta lya Sapanga, uleki kwaikiva lyugha hali wapeghwa wandu wamilima ghangi. Hagha wateutimbangatimbanga mbwani wa Sapanga kwa lipindi lya miehi mialobaini na ivili. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Nenga nitewapegha uweso watumikila ghangu waivili watelongela ujumbi ghangu lipalalipala kwa lipindi lya machuwa ielufu imonga na imia ivili na isitini, wakiwela wavala nguu zya magunila.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Watumikila hagha waivili ndiwa hila mizeituni miivili na vyombo vila viivili vya kuvikila limbamba vyeni kuvikwa kuulongolo gha Bambu mweni kulongosa mlima wogha. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Mundu yoyosi paateyesa kuwatenda, lyoto kuhuma mumlomu gha hagha watumikila utewayalamisa. Havi ndiwa atehova mundu yoyosi mweni kupala kuwatenda. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Wandu hagha wanguwesa kuwopa kunani ili ndonya ikotoho kutonya lipindi lyogha pawatewela wangulonga ulota wau. Na hilahila wetewela na uweso wa kuyaghalambusa masi yaweli mwahi na kuuhakila mlima wogha kwa matovo wekaweka kwa kila lipindi watepala weni.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Lipindi pawateyomola kulonga ujumbi wa Sapanga, likokolo likulunga lyeni kuhuma kuliwumba litali lya kumambi atetovana na weni, na mweni atewasinda na kuwakoma. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Mindumbi ghao itehighala kunjila gha mimbwani mikulunga, mula Bambu ghao avambilwi. Mlima hau uwela na ndyangilu handa gha mmbwani gha Sodoma na mlima wa Misili. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Wandu wa kila likabila na ukolu na mlima na langi watelolesa mindumbi hai kwa lipindi lya machuwa itatu na mayaghani, na watelekesela ng'ogha mundu yoyosi awasiki. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Wandu weni kulikala kumlimawogha watehekelela kwaikiva gha kihu kyau hagha waivili, watehina mhambu na kupeghana hupo, kwaikiva walota hagha waivili wawelili wanguwaghasa nesu. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ila badili gha ghala machuwa itatu na mayaghani mpumulo wa ukomu kuhuma kwa Sapanga akawayingila na weni wakatandamka, na wogha weni kuwalola wakatila nesu. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Hinu, wala walota waivili wakahyughanila lilowi likulunga kuhuma kundumba likiwalongela, “Mhiki kunu kunani!” Na weni wakayenda kunani kundumba kulihindu, wahakata ghao wakiwela wanguwalola. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Lipindi lilalila, kukahumila mhihimilu mkulunga kumlima, kipandi kimonga kya ikumi gha mbwani kikakologhanywa. Wandu ielufu isaba wakakomwa kwa mhihimilu hula wa kumlima. wandu wahighalili wakatila nesu, wakamtundamila Sapanga wa kundumba.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Mahakilo makulungwa gha ivili lupita, ila uloli! Lung'ai lwa itatu lunguhika kwa kuloposela.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipembi lya limgambo lya isaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Hinu yula mtumikila waisaba wa Sapanga wa kundumba akapulila lipembi lya limgambo lyaki, Na lilowi likulunga likahyoghanika kundumba likilonga, “Hinaa unkosi wa mlima wogha uwela unkosi wa Bambu wa twenga na Kilisito ghaki. Na atelongosa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu!” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Wala wagogolu waisilini na njechi weni kutama kweni vitamilu ghao vya ukulu kuulongolo gha Sapanga, wakaguwa kufulifuli na wakamyupa Sapanga, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />wakilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">“Tungukushukwile, wenga Bambu Sapanga mweni uweso wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">uwela na uwelili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">Kwaikiva uwonesa uwesa ghako mkulu, na hinaa ungulongosa.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Wandu weni kukwinila ng'ogha wa milima ghangi, wakuhyomela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">ila lipindi lya lilaka lyako lihika kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Ndiwa lipindi lya kuwatosa wala wahovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">hilahila ni lipindi lya kuwapegha hupo watumikila ghako walota</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">na wandu ghako wogha na wogha weni kukutundamila wenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">vilongosi na weni kuwela ng'ogha vilongosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">na lipindi lya kuwayalamisa wala weni kuwayaghamisa waghangi kumlimawogha.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Hinu Lighuta lya Sapanga liwelili kundumba likawopolwa na lisanduku lya Lilaghanu lyaki likawoneka hamu mghati. kukahumila lumuli na lilowi, na mlindimu wa ladi, na mhihimilu wa mlima na ndonya ngulunga gha maganga.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Mdala na linjoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Hinu, kukawoneka kilangihi kya makangasu kundumba, mdala mweni kuvikwa lijuwa na mwehi ukawela pahi gha maghulu ghaki, na kunani gha mutu ghaki kukawela na likokoma lya ndondwa ikumi na ivili. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Mdala hayu awelili na ndumbu, na mweni akalila nesu kwa lusungu kwaikiva awelili pabehi na kuliwopola.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Hinu, kilangihi kighangi kikawoneka kundumba, linjoka likulunga likeli lyeni vimutu viisaba na pembi ikumi na mikokoma isaba kuvimutu vyaki. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Kangi mkila ghaki ukawela ukikungula selusi imonga gha ndondwa zyogha zya kunani na kuzitagha pahi kumlimawogha. Ndiwa lila linjoka likagholoka kuulongolo gha yula mdala, mweni kuwela pabehi na kuliwopola ili lipati kummila mwana lipindi ateweleka. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Yula mdala akaiwopola mwana mlumi, atelongosa milima hyogha kwa hyatu ghaki gha lyuma. Ila hayu mwana akanyasulwa na kuyeghwa kwa Sapanga na kweni kitamilo kyaki kya kiinkosi. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Yula mdala akatuwilila kulivagha, kula Sapanga amyandalili mahala ili awesi kupeghwa mulyo haku kwa lipindi lya machuwa lya ielufu imonga na imia ivili na isitini.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Kuulongolo kukahumila ngondo kundumba. Mikaeli na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga wala kawela nau wakatovana na linjoka lila, na linjoka likiwela na watumikila ghaki likatovana na weni. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Ila linjoka na watumikila ghaki wakasindwa, na wakawingwa wahuki kundumba. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Lila linjoka likulunga likadangwa pahi, linjoka hali ndiwa lila linjoka lya dahile lyeni kuwela likikemwa hilahila Mlulunganyi au Lihyukana, lyeni kuungonga mlima wogha. Likadangwa pahi kumlimawogha, lyeni na watumikila ghaki wogha.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Hinu, nikahyughanila lilowi likulunga kuhuma kundumba likilonga, “Hinaa uhika ukombola na makakala na unkosi wa Sapanga wa twenga, na ulongosi wa Kilisito ghaki! Kwaikiva yula mweni kuwasitaki walongo wa twenga kuulongolo gha Sapanga kataghwa pahi, chakaka kataghwa pahi hayu mweni kuwasitaki uhiku na pamuhi. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Wakwinila wayetu wakamsinda kwa mwahi gha Mwanakondolu na kwa kulonga uchakaka kwa habali gha Yesu, weni walolile ng'ogha yiwa ngalilu zyau yiwa ndiwa zya maha, watilile ng'ogha kihu katu. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Hinu uhekeleli, wenga kundumba na wogha weni kulikala hamu! Ila watekolwa na mahakata wala wogha wenikulikala kumlimawogha na kubahali, kwaikiva yula mlulunganyi kahuluka kwa mwenga, na mweni kamema lilaka, kwaikiva angumanya yiwa lipindi lihighala ni lihupi nesu.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Linjoka lila palimanya yiwa lihuluswa pahi kumlimawogha, likamkovekela yula nyongo mwenikuwela kaliwopola mwana mlumi. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Ila nyongo hayu akapeghwa mbapatilo ziivili gha tai awesi kuhuluka kuyenda. Ayendi mbaka kuluvagha kula ayandalililwi awesi kuvikwa maha kwa machuwa ielufu imonga imia ivili na isitini. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Hinu, lila linjoka likalukula masi matangala handa lweni, ili yamtutiki hayu nyongo. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ila mlima ukamtanga hayu nyongo, ukajigubutula handa mlomo na kumila masi ghala yeni kuhuma kumlomu gha linjoka lila. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Hinu, linjoka lila likamhyomela nesu hayu nyongo, na likahuka, likayenda kutovana na wana ghaki waghangi. Wana wa mdala ni wala wandu weni kuyitikila lilando lya Sapanga na wangulongela ghala Yesu avulile. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Hinu, lila linjoka likagholoka muufuo wa bahali.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Mikokolu mikalipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Hinu, nikalola likokolu limonga lya mkalipa, likihumila mghati gha bahali. Liwelile na vimutu isaba na pembi zyaki ikumi, na kunani gha kila pembi lyaki kuwelile na likokoma, na kila kumutu ghaki kuwelile na lihina lya kumlighu Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Likokolu hali liwonekanili handa chui, maghulu ghaki yawelile handa likokola likemilwi dubu, lilomo lyaki liwelile handa lya himba. Lila linjoka likampegha hayu likokolu makakla ghaki wogha na kitamilo kyaki kya ukulu na ulongosi mkulu. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Mutu mmonga gha hayu likokolo kiwelili handa livanga likulunga, ila lilonda lyaki liwelile lilamiswa kala. Wandu wogha kumlimawogha wawelile walikangasa na hayu likokolu na kumkovekela. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Wandu wakawela wangumyupa yula linjoka kwaikiva ampeghili yula likokolu uwesa ghaki. Hilahila wakawela wangumyupa yula likokolu, “Wakilongela ni ghani mweni kuwela handa hali likokolu? Ni ghani mweni kuwesa kutovana nayu?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Hayu likokolu akapeghwa uweso wa kulongela milando gha kuitutumula na kumlighu Sapanga. Na akalekeselwa kulongosa kwa lipindi lya miehi ialobaini na ivili. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Akatumbula kumlighu Sapanga, akililighu lihina lyaki na kumahala katama na wala kawela nau haku kundumba. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Hilahila akalekeselwa atovani na wandu wa Sapanga na kuwasinda, akapeghwa uwesa wa kulongosa kwa kila likabila na ukolu na luga na mlima. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Wandu watangala weni kulikala kumlima wogha watemyupa mkokolu hai, ila wala wavile mahina ghao yayandikwa kukihitabu kya ukomu kya Mwanakondolu ahinjilwi kuhuma mtumbulo wa mlima wogha wamyupile ng'ogha. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Mwenikuwela na mapulukilo gha kuhyoghanila na ahyoghanili.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Paikawela mundu kavikilwa lukani lwa kuwela muhusutu, atewela muhusutu, na yula mweni kuvikilwa lukani lwa kukomwa kwa lipanga, atekomwa kwa lipanga. Kwa nagha wandu wa Sapanga wangupalwa waweli na ufumilifu na weni kuyendelela kukwinila.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Hinu, nikalola likokolu lighangi, likikwela kunani kuhuma kumlima, na lyeni liwelili na pembi miivili handa kondolu na likalongela handa linjoka lingulonga. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Likokolu hali likawela na makakala zyogha zya kulongosa kuhuma kwa lila likokolu lya mtumbulo. Likokolu hau lya ivili kawalasimisa wandu wogha kumlimawogha kumyupila likokola likulunga lya mtumbulo ndiwa mweni lilonda lya kihu lilamisilwi. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Hinu hali likokolu likalipa hali lya ivili likaghola makangaso makulunga hata akayambusa lyoto kuhuma kundumba lihuluki kumlima wogha wandu wakilola. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Anguwangongili dahile wandu watangala wenikulikala kumlimawogha kwa makangaso apeghilwi kuyaghola na lila likokolo lya mtumbulo, awalongilile wahongoli ming'omung'omu kwa kumtundamilisa lila likokolu mwenikudumulwa na lipanga ila akayendelela kulama. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Hinu akapeghwa uweso wa kulipegha mpumulo lila ling'omung'omu lya likokolu lila lya mtumbulo, ili liwesi kulongela na kuwayambusa wala wogha walemili kuliyupa lila ling'omung'omu wakomwi. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Hilahila awalasimisili kila mmonga, mnung'una na mkulunga na mnaisa na kapuku na mundu muhusutu na mweni kuwela ng'ogha muhusutu, avikwi kilangihi kuliwoku lyaki lya kuliyila au kukivungi kya wuso. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Kangi akalemesa mundu yeyosi mweni kuwela ng'ogha na kilangihi haki akotoho kuwusa wala kuhemela. Kilangihi haki ni lihina lya likokolu hali likulunga au inamba gha lihina lyaki.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Mghalu hau ungupala luhala, mweni malangu anguwesa kughalambula yiwa inamba gha likokolu hali ingumanisa niki, kwaikiva ni inamba gha mundu, inamba hazi ni imia isita na sitini na isita.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwanakondolu na wandu ghaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Hinu nikalola Mwanakondolu kagholoka kunani gha litumbi Sayuni. Na mweni awelili pamonga na wandu ilaki imonga na ielufu ialobaini na njechi, na kunani gha kibhungi kya wuso gha wandu ghaki kuwelili kuyandikwa lihina lyaki na lihina lya Tati ghaki. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Nikahyoghanila lilowi kuhuma kundumba handa lilowi lya masi matangala yeni kuyenda kwa kuloposela, na handa mlindimu mkulu wa ladi, lilowi hali nilihyoghanilile liwelile handa lilowi lya ligombogombo vikuwilwi na wandu watangala. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Wawelili wanguyimba uyimbu mhyonu kuulongolo gha kitamilo kya kinkosi na kuulongolo gha wala viumbi wakomu wanjechi na wala wagogolo. Kwahela mundu awesili kulivula uyimbu hau, ila wandu wala ilaki imonga na ielufu ialobaini na njechi wala weni kukombolwa kumlima wogha ndiwa weni kuumanya. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Wandu hagha ndiwa wala wahighalile kundambu gha kujumilwa na Sapanga bila kuwonja na wadala. Weni wangumkovekela mwanakondolu kila paayendili. Hagha wakombolilwi kuhuma kwa wandu waghangi, wakagholwa litambiku lya mtumbulo kwa Sapanga na kwa Mwanakondolu. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Weni katu walongela ng'ogha uhwangi, wala wawelili ng'ogha na uhakata wowosi.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumikila waitatu wa kundumba wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Hinu nikamlola mtumikila mghangi wa kundumba akijumba kunani, na mweni awelili na kihitabu kya Habali Maha gha machuwa hyogha bila mwihu na kuwatangasila wala wandu wogha wangulikala kumlima wogha, kwa kila mlima, na likabila, na luga, na ukolu. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Akalongela kwa lilowi likulunga, “Mtundamili Sapanga na mpeghi ukulu, kwaikiva lisaa lya Sapanga kuwatosa wandu wogha lihika kala. Mumyupi mweni alumbili kundumba na mlima wogha na bahali na uhimbuki wa masi.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Mtumikila waivili wa kundumba wa Sapanga akakovikela akilonga, “Uguwa! Uguwa Babeli mmbwani mkulu, kwaikiva ndiwa weni kuwalowelesa milima hyogha difwai likalipa lya ungongola ghaki.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Na mtumikila wa itatu wa kundumba wa Sapanga awakovekelili wala waivili akalonga kwa lilowi likulunga, “Handa mundu yoyosi atemyupa hayu likokolo na ling'omung'omu lyaki na kuvikwa kilangihi kyaki kukibungi kya wusu ghaki au mmawoko ghaki, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />mweni hilahila atenywegha difwai gha lilaka lya Sapanga yeni kuhanganywa kukikombi kya lilaka lyaki Sapanga bila kuhanganywa na masi. Mundu hayu atehakilwa kwa lyoto lya madini gha baluti kuulongolo gha watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga na kuulongolo gha Mwanakondolu. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Lyohi lya lyoto lyeni kuwahakila lingukwela kunani machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. Wandu hagha weni kuliyupa hali likokolu na ling'omung'omu lyaki na kuvikwa kilangihi kya lihina lyaki, watepumlila ng'ogha pamuhi na uhiku.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Hinu, wangupalwa wandu wa Sapanga, wala weni kuyitikila malaghilo gha Sapanga na kumkwinila Yesu, waweli na ufumilifu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Kuulongolo nikahyoghanila lilowi kuhuma kundumba, likilongela, “Uyandiki hali, kutumbula hinaa watehighilwa wandu wogha wenikuhova wakiwela wangumkwinila Bambu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Na mweni Mpumulo wa Sapanga akalongela,“Hina watepumulila kuhuma kulung'ai lwau kwaikiva ghala ghamaha wayagholile yatewela pamonga na weni.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu wa mlima wogha wangubenwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Nikalolesa, nikalola lihindu mbulete na kunani gha lihindu lila atamili mundu mweni kulandana na mwana wa mundu mweni likokoma lya zahabu kumutu ghaki na kukola mbopu kuliwoku lyaki. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Hinu mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mghangi akahuma Mlighuta lya Sapanga, na mweni akamkema kwa lilowi likulunga yula awelili katama kunani gha lila lihindu akilonga, “Utoli mbopu ukabeni kwaikiva lipindi lya mabeno lihika kala, kwaikiva mabeno gha kumlima wogha yakamala kala.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Yula mundu mweni kulikala kunani gha lihindu, akabena mabeno gha mlima wogha.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Hinu, mtumikila mghangi wa kundumba wa Sapanga akahuma Kulighuta lya Sapanga lya kundumba akiwela na mbopu kikalipa kya kubenela.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Kuulongolo mtumikila mghangi wa kundumba wa Sapanga mwenikuwela mgholokela wa lyoto, akahuka kukihanja, akamlongela kwa lilowi likulunga yula mtumikila mweni mbopu kikalipa, “Utoli mbopu lyako lyeni kuwela kikalipa na udumuli vikonyu vya sabibu kuhuma kulitawa kwaikiva sabibu zipia kala.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Hinu, mtumikila wa kundumba hayu akadumula kwa mbopu lyaki mlima wogha, akadumula sabibu sya mlima wogha, akazivika mghati gha kyombo kikulunga kya kukamulila sabibu, kyombu haki ni lilaka lya Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Sabibu sikakamulwa iwelili panji na mmbwani, mwahi ukahululuka kuhuma mghati gha kila kyombu kya kukamulila ikawela handa mlweni mkulunga mbaka ikahika utali wa kilomita imia itatu, na utali kuyenda pahi uwelili imita imonga na inusu.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga na lung'ai lwa mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Hinu nikalola vilangihi vighangi kunani, vikulu na vyenikukangasa, watumikila isaba weni lung'ai isaba gha mwihu, kwaikiva kukovekelana na lung'ai halu lilaka lwa Sapanga lutewela lutimila.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Nilolile handa bahali gha kiou yenikuhanganyika na lyoto. Wala wogha wamsindili likokolo na ling'omung'omu lyaki na inamba gha lihina lyaki wawelili wagholoka mmbali gha bahali. Wandu hagha wawelili na ligombogombo wapeghilwi na Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Wawelili wakiyimba uyimbo gha Musa, mtumikila wa Sapanga na wa Mwanakondolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">“Bambu Sapanga mweni makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">matendu ghako ni makulu na yenikukangasa nesu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Wenga nkosi wa milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">njila zyaku ni zya chakaka na zingujumilika.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Bambu ni ghani ateleka kukuyitikila wenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Ghani ateleka kuliyinula lihina lyaku?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Wenga weka yaku ndiwa wamaha nesunesu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Wandu wa milima hyogha itekuhikila na kukuyupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">kwaikiva matendu ghako gha chakaka yawoneka paluagha.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Badili gha hagha nikalola Lighuta lya Sapanga liwopolwa kundumba, lighuta hali liwelili handa lihema lya Sapanga, pavile Sapanga atamili pamonga na wandu ghaki kulivaghana. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Hinu, wala watumikila wa Sapanga wa kundumba isaba weni lung'ai isaba wakahuma hamu Mulighuta lya Sapanga, wakiwela wavwala nguu mbulete pee zyeni kung'anyima na wavwala mihungi gha sahabu kuvitivi vyau. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ndiwa mmonga wa wala viumbi wanjechi weni ukomu akawapegha wala watumikila isaba wa kundumba wa Sapanga mabakuli isaba gha zahabu yenikumema lilaka lya Sapanga, mweni kulikala machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Lighuta lya Sapanga likamema lyohi lyenikuyambuswa na ukulu na uwesa wa Sapanga, na kwahela mundu awesili kuyingila mbaka yatimili malung'ai hyogha isaba gha wala watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga isaba.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Mabakuli isaba gha lilaka lya Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Hinu nikahyoghanila lilowi likulunga likihuma Kulighuta lya Sapanga likiwalongela wala watumikila isaba wa kundumba wa Sapanga, “Mkayiti yala mabakuli isaba gha lilaka gha Sapanga kunani gha mlima wogha!”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Mtumikila wa mtumbula wa kundumba wa Sapanga akayenda akayita libakuli lyaki kunani gha mlima. Malipu mahakata na yeni kuhakila nesu yaka wahumila wala wandu weni kilangihi kya yula likokolo na wala wayupili ling'omung'omu lyaki.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Mtumikila wa waivili wa akayita libakuli lyaki mbahali, Na bahali ikawela mwahi hela handa mwahi gha mundu ahovili, na viumbi vyogha mbahali vikahova.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Mtumikila wa itatu wa akayita libakuli lyaki kunani gha milweni na uhimbuki gha masi na masi ghala hyogha yakahyuka kuwela mwahi. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Nikamhyoghanila mtumikila mweni kugholokela masi akilonga, “Wenga mwenikutimila, mwenikuwela na uwelili! Wenga ughola vila ingupalwa kwa kutosa nagha, <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />kwaikiva wawakomili walota ghako na wandu ghako. Hinaa uwapegha wandu hagha wahakata mwahi ili wanyweghi, haki ndiwa wangupalwa wapokeli.” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Hilahila nikahyoghanila lilowi kuhuma kukihanja likilongela, “Hina Bambu Mweni Makakala! Utoso unguughola ni wa chakaka na ungughola vila ingupalwa.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Hinu mtumikila wa njechi wa kundumba wa Sapanga akayita libakuli lyaki kulijuwa. Lijuwa likapeghwa makakala gha kuwanyanya wandu kwa lyoto lyaki. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Kwa nagha wandu wakanyanywa nesu, wakamlighu Sapanga mweni uwesa kunani gha lung'ai lyogha, ila walekila ng'ogha sambi na kumhyukila Sapanga na kumpegha ukulu.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Mtumikila wa mhanu wa kundumba wa Sapanga akayita libakuli lyaki kukitamilo kya ulongosi kya likokolo, lwiha likavamila ulongosi ghaki, wandu wakaluma milimi ghao kwaikiva gha mahakilo. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Wakamlighu Sapanga wa kundumba kwaikiva gha mahakilo yawakolile na vilonda wawela navyu. Ila walekili ng'ogha sambi wasigholili na kumhyukila Sapanga.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Hinu, Mtumikila wa isita akayita libakuli lyaki kunani gha lweni mkulunga wenikukemwa Fulati. Masi ghaki yakayuma, ili kuyandala njila gha wankosi wenikuhuma kuhumila lijuwa. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Kuulongolo nikalola mahoka waitatu wenikuwela handa miyula, wakihuma kumlomo wa lila linjoka na mmonga mumlomo wa yula likokolo na mmonga mumlomo wa yula mlota wa uhwangi. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Hagha ndiwa mipumulo gha mahoka weni kughola makangaso, Ndiwa wenikuyenda kwa nkosi wa mlima wogha na kuwakungula pamonga kwaikiva gha ngondo gha lichuwa lila likulunga lya Sapanga mweni makakala.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Uhyughanili nenga ninguhika handa mwihi! Kahighilwa mundu yula mweni kukesa na kuvala nguu zyaki ili akotoho kutyanga ngelengi haku na haku na akotoho kuwona honi kuulongolo gha wandu.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Ndiwa wakawakungula wankosi lipinga kumahala kwa Kiebulania pangukemwa Hamagedoni.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Hinu, mtumikila wa isaba wa kundumba wa Sapanga akayita libakuli lyaki kunani. Lilowi likulunga likahyoghanika kuhuma kukitamilo kya kinkosi, Kulighuta lya Sapanga, “Hyogha yayomoka!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Kukahumila lumuli, lilowi, mlindimu na mhihimilo mkulunga wa mlima weni uhumilili ng'ogha kuhuma kwa kulumbwa kwa mundu. Hinu hali liwelili mhihimilo mkulunga wa kukangasa. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Mmbwani wula mkulu wa Babeli ukabalulwa pandi itatu, na yeni mimbwani gha milima hyogha, ikayalamika. Sapanga aukumbwike Babeli hula uwelili mkulu na kuupegha kikombi kya difwai lya lilaka lyaki likulunga. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Kila Vihisiwa vikawuka na mitumbi iwonekana ng'ogha. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Ndonya gha maganga, makulunga yeni utopehu wa handa kilu iamsini kila lindwendi limonga, yakawaguwila wandu, Na weni wandu wakamlighu Sapanga kwaikiva gha lula lung'ahi lwa ndonya gha maganga, kwaikiva hali liwelili likulunga nesu.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Mdala mngognola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Mmonga wa wala watumikila isaba wawelili na yala mabakuli isaba akahika akanilongela, “Uhiki, nitekulangiha yula mngongola vila atenyokolwa. Mweni kulikala kunani gha masi yatangala. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Wankosi wa mlima wogha waghola ngongola pamonga na mweni, na wandu wa mlima wogha walowela difwai gha ngongola ghaki.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Hinu Mpumulo wa Sapanga akanilongosa mbaka kulivagha. Haku nimuwonili mdala atamili kunani gha likokolo mkeli mweni awelili kayandikwa higha hyogha mahina gha kumlighu Sapanga. Likokolo hayu awelili na mitu isaba na pembi zyaki ikumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Hayu mdala awelili kavala nguu zya langi gha sambalau, na ngeli, akililemba kwa vindu vya zahabu, madini gha mapesa ngoo na lulu mmawoko ghaki awelili kakola kikombi kya zahabu kimemili mighalu gha kuhyomela na matendu mahakata gha kulangiha vila angughola ngongola. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Kweni kibhungi kyaki kya wusu ghaki kayandikwa lihina lya kuhigha, “Babeli mkulu, nyongo wa waghola ngongola na mighalu gha kuhyomela kumlima wogha.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Hinu nimuwonili yula mdala kalowela mwahi gha wandu wa Sapanga, na mwahi gha wandu wakomilwi kwaikiva gha kumtangasa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Panimlolili mdala hayu, nilikangasili nesu. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Ila mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akanilongela, “kwa kyani ungulikangasa? Nenga nitekulongela kifisu kya mkokola hayu mweni mitu isaba na pembi zyaki ikumu na kifisu kya mdala hayu ampapili. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Hayu likokolo, mweni umuwonili, lipindi limonga awelili, ila hinaa kahova, na mweni anguliyandala kuhuma ila ateyalamiswa. Wandu wogha kumlima wogha mahina ghao yayandikwa ng'ogha kukihitabu kya ukomu kuhuma kulumbwa kwa mlima wogha watekangaswa kulola likokolo hayu mweni dahile awelili hinu akahova na hinaa atehumila kangi.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Mghalu hau ungupalwa luhala na malangu. Vila mitu isaba mweni yula mdala atamili kunani ghaki ni mitumbi isaba na wankosi isaba. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Na paghati gha wala wankosi isaba, wamhanu wahova kala, na mmonga akali akilongosa na yula ghangi yambila kahika ng'ogha, na patehika atelongosa lipindi lya mayaghani. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Hayu likokolo awelili mkomu haku kuhyetu ila hinaa kangulama ng'ogha kangi, mweni ni nkosi wainane. Ni paghati gha wala wankosi waisaba wamtumbulo, na mweni kanguyenda kuyalamiswa.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Na zila pembi ikumi usilolili ni wankosi ikumi wawelili wambila kupokela unkosi ila weni watepokela uweso wa kulongosa kwa lipindi lya lisaa limonga pamonga na yula likokolo. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Hagha wawela na mghalu mmonga, na weni watemlekela yula likokolo makakala ghao na ulongosi ghao. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Watetovana na Mwanakondulu, ila Mwanakondolu atewasinda kwaikiva mweni ni Bambu wa mabambu na mnkosi wa wakosi mweni atewela na pamonga na wandu ghaki awakemili, na wahaghulilwi ghaki, wala wayendelela kumkwinila.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akanilongela kangi, “Yala masi uyalolili pala paatamili yula mghola ngongola, ni mapinga gha wandu wa kila mlima na ukolu na luga.” <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Zila pembi zyaki ikumi uzilolili, pamonga na hayu likokolo, watemhyomela hayu mghola ngongola, na watetola kila kindu na kumleka bila nguu, na watemlyegha liwondu lyaki na mihupa ihighalili na yeni iteyalamiswa kwa lyoto. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Sapanga mweni kawaghola watimisi lukani lyaki, kwa kujumila kumpegha yula likokolo uweso ghao wa kulongosa mbaka yala alongili Sapanga yahumili.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />“Na yula mdala umulolili ndiwa hula mbwani mkulu weni kulongosa wankosi wa mlima wogha.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Kuguwa kwa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Badili gha hagha, nikalola mtumikila mghangi wa kundumba wa Sapanga akihuluka kuhuma kundumba. Awelili na uweso mkulu, na mlima wogha ukalangaswa kwa mng'anyimu ghaki. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Mweni kwa lilowi likulunga, akalonga, “Uguwa! uguwa mmbwani mkulunga wa Babeli! Uwela mahala kwa Lihyukana na mahoka, na mahala kwa kila mbongu wahakata na mahala kwa kila likokolo lihakata na lyeni kuhyomelwa.” <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Kwaikiva wandu wogha wa mlima wogha yanywegha uyimbi wa ngongola ghaki. Na wankosi wa mlima wogha waghola ngongola na mweni, na waghola biasala wa mlima wogha wapokela unaisa kwaikiva kana utangala gha hindu ghaki.<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Hinu nikayoghanila lilowi kangi kuhuma kundumba ikilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">“Wandu ghangu mhumi kweni mmwani hau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">mkotoho kukughola vindu vihakata vyeni wandu ghaki wangughola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">ili mkotoho kupokela unyokola uvile Sapanga ateyegha kwa weni.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Kwaikiva sambi syaki siwelili sitangala nesu, sililundika mbaka kundumba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:5">na Sapanga akumbwikile uhakata ghao.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Mumgholeli handa mweni awagholili mwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">mumlipi mihanja ivili kwa yala ayagholili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">Mhanganyileni kukitekelo kyaki mihanja ivili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">gha hila difwai ikalipa aihanganyili.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Mumpeghi mahakilo na malumbililo kwa vila anguitutumula na ngalilu ghaki gha kuipala mweni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">kwaikiva mmuoyu ghaki kanailongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">‘Nenga ni malikiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Nenga nihovilwi ng'ogha na mlumi ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">wala nitewela ng'ogha na malumbililo.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Kwa nagha mahakata gha kutila yatemkola kwa lichuwa limonga, mavina makulunga na malumbililu na njala ngulunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">na mweni ateyalamiswa kwa lyoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">kwaikiva Bambu Sapanga mweni kumtosa kana makakala.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Wankosi wa mlima wogha wala wagholile ngongola na mweni na kulama nayu kungalilu ghaki gha unaisa. Watelila na kulumbilila pawalola akilumbilila. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Wakigholoka kutali kwa holu kukovekelana na mahakilo ghaki wakilonga, “Yatekupata mahakata wenga mmbwani wa Babeli, mmbwani mkulunga na weni uweso! Utoso ghako uhika kwa lisaa limonga.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Waghola biasala wa mlima wogha watelila na kumlumbililila, kwaikiva kwahela mundu mweni kuhemela kangi vindu kuhuma kwa weni, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />kwahela kangi wa kuhemela zahabu gha weni na madini gha feza na maganga gha mapesa ngoo na madini gha lulu. Na nguu mbulete nesu na nguu zya langi lya zambalau na halili na nguu keli. Na vyombu vya mibiki vya kila ndambu na vyombu vya pembi zya ndembu na gha mibiki gha mapesa ngoo na gha shaba na gha lyuma na malumalu. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Hilahila kwahela wa kuhemela mdalasini na iliki na ufumba na manungilu na ubani. Na difwai na mahuta gha miseituni na ukowa maheli na nganu. Na ng'ombi na kondolu na fwalasi na mbutuka gha kukweghwa na falasi na wahusutu, na wandu waghangi. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Waghola biasala wangumlongela, “Vindu vyogha uwelili unguvipala nesu viyalamika, vindu vyogha vya mapesa ngenju na vya unaisa vikugholili uwoneki mzuli viyalamika, katu vitewela ng'ogha kangi.” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Waghola biasala weni kuwela wanaisa kupitila mmbwani hau wategholoka kutali na weni. Kwaikiva gha kutila mahakilo ghaki. Watelila na kulumbilila, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />wakilonga, “Mighalu mihakata ikukola, mighalu mihakata ikukola mbwani hau mkulunga. Uwelili unguvaliswa nguu mbulete nesu na zya langi gha sambalau na ngeli, na uwelili unguvikwa malembu gha zahabu na maganga gha mapesa ngenju na madini gha lulu! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Kwa lisa limonga hela unahisa ghako uyaghanika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Kangi walongosa whatu ngulunga wogha na wayenda mwanja ghao na wandu weni kughola biasala mubahali na weni kughola mahengu mbahali, wategholoka kwa kutali, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />na pawatelola lyosi lya kulungula mmbwani hau, watelila kwa lilowi wakilonga, “Uwoneka ng'ogha mmbwani mkulunga handa mmbwani hau!” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Wateyitila malifu kunani gha mitu ghao kulangiha yiwa wangulumbilila. Watelila wakilonga, “Ungukolwa na mahakata, ungukolwa na mahakata kwa mbwani mkulunga! Mlima weni kuwela wandu wogha weni kuwela na whatu ngulunga zyeni kutyanga mbahali waweli wanaisa kukovekelana na unaisa wa mbwani hau, kwa lipindi lya lisaa limu hela uyalamisa kila kindu.”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Uhekeleli wenga ungulama kundumba, kwaikiva gha uyalamisu gha mmbwani hau. Mhekeleli wandu wa Sapanga, wandumindumi na walota wa Sapanga! Sapanga kautosa mmbwani hau kwaikiva gha mighalu uyagholili kwa mwenga!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Hinu, mtumikila mmonga wa kundumba wa Sapanga mweni makakala akanyakula liganga likulunga handa lya kuhyaghila akalidangila mbahali akilonga, “Havi ndiwa mmbwani mkulunga Babeli utedangwa pahi kwa makakala wala utewoneka ng'ogha kangi.” <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Kummbwani hau kutehyoghanika ng'ogha wandu wakiyimba na wakikuwa ligombogombo na wakikuwa filimbi na wakikuwa lipembi lya limgambo, wala fundi yoyosi mweni uweso wa kughola vindu wala nyimbu zya wandu wa kuhyagha. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Kangi kutewela ng'ogha na mhana wa limbamba utelangasa, wala kutewela ng'ogha na lilowi lya mhambu gha bambu wa uposo na mdala wa uposo. Waghola biasala ghako wawelili wakulunga mlima wogha, na kwa uhawi ghako milima hyogha yabyodoswili.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Mmbwani hau unyokolilwi kwaikiva hamu upatikanili mwahi gha walota wa Sapanga, na mwahi gha wandu wa Sapanga na gha wandu wogha wakomilwi kumlimawogha, Ziwonekanili kumbwani hau.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Badili gha hagha nikahyoghanila lilowi handa gha lipinga lya wandu watangala kundumba wakilonga, “Ayinulwi Sapanga! Ulokola na ukulu na makakala ni gha Sapanga watwenga. <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Kwaikiva angutosa vila ingupala na kwa uchakaka. Sapanga wa twenga kamtosa yula mghola ngongola mkulunga kwa kuughola mlima wogha kughola matendu mahakata. Sapanga kamnyokola kwaikiva gha kuwakoma watumikila ghaki Sapanga.” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Wakalonga kangi kwa makakala, “Ayinulwi Sapanga! lyohi lya lyoto lyeni kuyalamisa mmbwani hau litekwela kunani machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Na wala wagogolu waisilini na njechi na wala viumbi wakomu wanjechi wakaguwa kifulifuli, wakamyupila Sapanga atamili kukitamilo kya kinkosi wakalonga, kwa lilowi likulungaa, “Hina! Ayinulwi Sapanga!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhambu wa uposo gha Mwanakondolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Hinu, kukahumila lilowi kukitamilo kya kinkosi ikilonga, “Mumyinuli Sapanga wa twenga, mwenga watumikila ghaki wogha, mwenga weni kumtundamila, wanung'una kwa wakulunga.” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Hinu nikayoghanila lilowi handa lya lipinga likulunga lya wandu, na handa lilowi lya masi yatangala na gha mlindimu mkulunga wa ladi, wakitova lilowi wakilonga, “Ayinulwi Sapanga! Kwaikiva Bambu Sapanga wa twenga mweni likakala angulongosa. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Tuhekeleli na kukuwa vilulu, na tumyinuli, kwaikiva lipindi lya uposu gha mwana kondolu ifika kala na mdala wa uposu kaiyandala kala. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Mdala wa uposo kapeghwa nguu gha kuvala mbulete na yeni kung'anyimo nesu.” Nguu hai ni mlandano wa matendu yeni kujumilwa na Sapanga yeni kugholwa na wandu wa Sapanga.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Hinu mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akanilongela, uyandiki hagha, “Mbaha wala wakemilwi kweni mhambu gha mulyo gha uposu gha Mwanakondolu!” Na mweni akayongesa kulonga “Hagha ni milandu gha chakaka gha Sapanga.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Hinu nenga nikaguwila kifulifuli kuulongolu ghaki ili nimyupili, ila mweni akanilongela, “Ukotoho kughola nagha! Nenga ni mtumikila hela handa wenga na walongu ghako. Wogha tungulongelela habali zya Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Nagha myupile Sapanga weka ghaki. Kwaikiva yala wanguyalonga walota yanguhuma kwa Yesu.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkosi mkulu kunani gha falasi mmbulete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Hinu nikalola kundumba kuwopoka, na haku awelili falasi mmonga mbulete, na yula amkwelili falasi akemilwi “Mundu wa kutegemea na chakaka.” Hayu paatosa angughola vila ingupalwa na paangutovana ngondo angughola kwa chakaka. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Mihu ghaki ni handa myali gha lyoto na kunani gha mutu ghaki kuwelili na mikokoma mitangala. Awelili kayandikwa lihina lyeni kwahela mundu yoyosi kangulimanya ila kalimanya mweni hela. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Awelili kavala lihabiti lijwikilwi kumwahi, na lihina lyaki hayu ni “Lilando lya Sapanga.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Mapinga gha weni kulikala kundumba wakamkovekela mkwela falasi mbulete, na weni wakiwela wakwela falasi wambulete hilahila, weni wavala nguu nyanyi na mbulete nesu na maheli. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Kumlomo ghaki kunguhuma lipanga likalipa, atelitumila kusinda wandu wa milima hyogha, atelongosa kwa hyatu gha lyuma. Na mweni atekamula sabibu kweni kyombu kya kukamulila, kyeni kulangiha lilaka lya Sapanga mweni uweso wogha. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Kunani gha lihabiti lyaki, na kunani gha lipaja lyaki, awelili kayandikwa lihina, “Nkosi wa wankosi na Bambu wa mabambu.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Hinu nenga nikamlola mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mmonga agholokili kweni lijua, akawakema mbongu wogha waghuluka kunani, “Mhiki mlikunguli pamonga kwaikiva gha mhambu mkulunga wa Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Mhiki mlyegha mihigha gha wankosi na gha watovangondo wakulunga na gha wandu weni makakala, na gha falasi na gha wakwela falasi ghao, mhiki mkailyeghi mihigha gha wandu wogha, wawela ng'ogha wahusutu na wahusutu, wawelili wanung'una na wakulungwa.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Hinu nikalola yula mkokolo mkalipa na wankosi wa mlima wogha na watovangondo ghao. Wakiwela walikungula pamonga ili kughola ngondo kutovana na yula mkwela falasi mbulete na watova ndondo ghaki. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ila hayu mkokolo kakamulwa pamonga na hayu mlota wa uhwangi awelili kaghola kilangihi kwaikiva gha hayu likokolo, katumili mikangaso hai ili awalulunganyili wala wawelili na kilangihi kya hayu likokolo, na wala weni kuiyupila ling'omung'omu lyaki. Hayu mlota wa uhwangi na mkokolo wawela wadangilwi wawela wakomu kweni lihiwa lya lyoto likalipa. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Wala wahighalili wakomilwi kwa lipanga uhumili mumlomu mwa yula awelili mkwela falasi mmbulete, na mbongu wogha walyeghili mihigha hai mbaka wakayukuta.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Machuva ielufu imonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Hinu, nikamlola mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akihuluka kuhuma kundumba akiwela kakola ufunguu wa liwumba likulunga lya mlima wa wahovili na mnyololu mkulunga. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Akalikola lila linjoka mweni kuwela linjoka likulunga lya dahile, mweni kukemwa Mlulunganya au Lihyukana, akamwopa kwa minyololu kwa machuva ielufu imonga. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Akamdanga kulila liwumba lya kumlima wa wahovili akamuwopa mula na kulivika kibandiku ili kumlemesa akotoho kuwalulunganya wandu wa mlima wogha mbaka machuva hagha ielufu imonga yatimili, badili gha hagha lasima awopolwi kwa lipindi lihupi.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Hinu nikalola wala wapeghilwi uweso wa kutosa watama kuvitamilu vya kinkosi na nikalola mipumulo gha wala weni kudumulwa mutu kwaikiva gha kutangasa habali gha Yesu na kwaikiva gha lilando lya Sapanga. Wandu hagha wawelile ng'ogha wamyupa likokolo hali wala ling'omung'omu lyaki na wapokela ng'ogha hila kilangihi kya muuli kyaki. Kukibhungi kya wusu ghao au kumawoku ghao. Watumikila wa Sapanga hagha watepokela ukomu kangi na kulongosa pamonga na Kilisito machuva ielufu imonga. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Wala waghangi wahovili wahindulwa ng'ogha mbaka ila machuva ielufu imonga paitemila. Hau ndiwa uhindulu wa utumbulo. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Sapanga atewahighila nesu wala wandu awahindulo mtumbulo kangi watewela wandu wa Sapanga, kihu kya ivili kitewela ng'ogha na makakala kwa weni. Na weni watewela watambika wa Sapanga na Kilisito na watelongosa na mweni kwa machuva hai ielufu imonga.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anguyalamiswa Lihyukana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Badili gha machuvai ielfu imonga paitimila, Lihyukana atewopolwa kuhuma kukihungu kyaki, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />mweni atehuma ili kuwalulunganya wandu wawela kumlima wogha kogha, ingumanisa gogu na magogu. Lihyukana litewakungula pamonga kwaikiva gha ngondu na weni watewela watangala handa mhanga wa ufuoni. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Watyangili kumlima wogha kogha wakatindila pala walikala wandu wa Sapanga na mmbwani wa Sapanga anguupala, ila lyoto ukahuluka kuhuma kundumba na kuwayalamisa. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Na mweni Lihyukana mweni uwalulunganya akadangwa kweni lihiwa lyeni lyoto likalipa na baluti. Hamu ndiwa wataghilwi wala likokola lila likulunga na mlota yula wa uhwangi, na weni watehakilwa pamuhi na uhiku machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utoso wa mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Hinu, nikalola kitamilo kya kinkosi kikulunga kimbulete kya na mweni akikalili kukitamilo haki, kundumba na mlima vikahuka kuulongolo ghaki na viwonekana ng'ogha kangi. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Nikawalola wandu wakulunga na wanung'una wahovili wagholoka kuulongolo gha kila kitamilo kya kinkosi. Vihitabu vikagubutulwa, hinu kihitabu kighangi kikagubutulwa na kyeni ni kihitabu kya ukomu. Wandu wahovili wakatoswa kukovekelana na matendu ghao yeni kuyandikwa kweni vihitabu havi. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Bahali ikawahumisa wandu wahovili weni kuwela hamu, kihu na liwumba likulunga lya mlima wa wahovili vitehumila wandu weni kuwela hamu. Kila mundu atetoswa kukovekelana na matendu ghaki. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Hinu, kihu na liwumba likulunga lya wandu wahovili litetaghwa kulihiwa lila lya lyoto na baluti. Hali lihiwa lya lyoto na baluti ndiwa kihu kya ivili. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Mundu yoyosi mweni kuwela lihina lyaki liyandikwa ng'ogha kukihitabu kya ukomu na mweni hilahila ataghilwi kulihiwa lya lyoto na baluti.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Kundumba kuhyonu na mlima wogha mhyonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Hinu, nikalola kundumba kuhyonu na mlima wogha mhyonu. Kundumba ila ya kwa mtumbulo na mlima wogha wa mtumbulo viwelile vihuka, na bahali hilahila ikahuka. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Nikalola mmbwani wa Sapanga, Yelusalemu hyonu yenikuwela mmbwani wa Sapanga, ukihuluka kuhuma kundumba kwa Sapanga. Uwelile uyandalwa maheli handa mdala wa uposo mweni kuvikwa malembu kwaikiva gha mngwana ghaki. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Hinu nikahyoghanila lilowi likulunga kuhuma kukikalilo kya kiinkosi likilonga, “Hinaa Sapanga atelikala paghati kwa weni, Sapanga atelikala pamonga na weni, watewela wandu ghaki, Sapanga mweni atewela na weni na mweni atewela Sapanga ghao.” <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Mweni ateyapyata masosi ghao hyogha, kwaikiva kuhwegha kutewoneka ng'ogha kangi, wala malumbililo, wala kililo, wala mahakilo, kwaikiva mighalu gha mtumbulo ipita kala.<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Hinu, yula mweni kutama kunani gha kikalilo kya kiinkosi akalonga, Uloli ningughola hyogha mahyonu. Kangi akanilongela , “Uyandiki mghalu hau, kwaikiva milando hai ni gha kujumilika na gha chakaka!” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Akalongela kangi, “Yatimila! Nenga ni Alufa na Omega, Mtumbulo na Mwihu. Yula mweni kuwela na kuyumilila nitempegha masi gha ukomu anyweghi bila kuhipa chochosi, . <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Yula mweni kusinda mighalu mihakata atepokela hagha hyogha, nenga nitewela Sapanga ghaki, na mweni atewela mwana ghangu. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ila wandu weni kutila, weni kulema kunikwinila, wahakata, wakomaji, na waghola ngongola, na wahawi, na watundamila ming'omung'omu, na wahwangi wogha, nitewatagha kulihiwa lyeni kuyaka lyoto na baluti. Haki ni kihu kya ipili.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelusalemu mhyonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Hinu mmonga wa wala watumikila isaba wa kundumba wa Sapanga weni kuwela na yala mabakuli isaba yenikuwela yamema lung'ai gha mwihu akahika na kunilongela, “Uhiki! Na nenga nitekulangiha mdala wa uposo, ngumanisa mhumbu wa Mwanakondolo!” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Hinu, Mpumulo wa Sapanga akanilongosa mbaka kula kulitumbi likulungu na litali akanilangiha Yelusalemu mmbwani wa Sapanga ukihuluka kuhuma kundumba kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Uwelili uking'anyima kwa ung'anyimu weni kuhuma kwa Sapanga. Mng'anyimu ghaki uwelili handa wa liganga lya mapesa matangala lyeni kulandana na madini gha yasipi, yeni kuwoneka maha. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Kuwelili na likuta likulunga kuutindila mbwani na kyeni milyango mikulunga ikumi na ivili, na pawelili na watumikila ikumi na ivili wa kundumba wa Sapanga kukila mlyango. Kunani gha milyango hila kuwelile kuyandikwa mahina gha makabila ikumi na ivili gha Waizilaeli. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kila upandi Kuwelile na milyango miitatu, mbandi gha kuhumila lijuwa kuwelili na milyango miitatu, na mbandi gha kaskazini kuwelili na milyango miitatu, na mbandi gha kusini kuwelili na milyango mitatu, na mbandi wa kuhongela lijuwa kuwelili na milyango miitatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Likuta lya mmbwani hau liwelili lichengwa kunani gha maganga ikumi na ivili gha kitamilo, na kunani gha kila liganga pawelile payandikwa imonga gha mahina gha wala wandumindumi ikumi na ivili wa Mwanakondolu. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Hinu yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mwenikuwela angulongela na nenga awelili na hyatu gha zahabu gha kupimila hau mmbwani, milyango ghaki na likuta lyaki. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Mmbwani hau uwelili ungulandana kila mbandi, utali ghaki ungulandana na lukingika ghaki. Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akapima mmbwani hula kwa hyatu ghaki, utali na lupingika na kimo lyaki uwela handa ikilomita ielufu ivili na imia njechi. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Hinu akapima unene wa likuta kyaki hilahila, na kyeni kiwelile na imita isitini kwa kipimu kya kimundu kila mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga awelile akikitumila. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Likuta haki kiwelile kichengwa kwa maganga makeli gha mapesa matangala yangukemwa yasipi, na mmbwani weni uwelile uchengwa kwa zahabu maha, yeni kung'anyima handa kiou. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Maganga gha kitamilo kya likuta kya mmbwani hau kiwelile kivikwa malembu gha ndambu wekaweka gha mapesa matangala. Liganga lya mtumbulo lya kitamilo liwelili ngeli, na lya ipili liwelile lya langi gha sambalau, lya itatu kalikedoni na lya injechi liwelili zumalidi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />lya mhanu liwelile salidoniki, na lya isita liwelile akiki, na lya isaba liwelile Kilisolito, na lya inane ni zabalajadi, na lya itisa manjanu, na lya ikumi kilisopulaso, na lya ikumi na imonga hiakinito, na lya ikumi na ivili ni amesisto. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Hilahila hila milyango mikulunga ikumi na ivili, iwelili ichengwa kwa lulu ikumi na ivili, na kila mlyango mmonga uchengwa kwa lulu imonga. Njila ngulunga gha mmbwani hau iwelili gha zahabu maheli yeni kung'anyima handa kiou.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Nenga niwonili ng'ogha Lighuta lya Sapanga kumbwani hau, kwaikiva Bambu Sapanga Mweni uwesa wogha na yula Mwanakondolu weni ndiwa Lighuta lya Sapanga kumbwani hau. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Mbwani hau ungupala ng'ogha mhana wa lijuwa wala mbalamwehi, kwaikiva ukulu wa Sapanga wenikuhuma kwa Sapanga unguulangasila mmbwani hau na limbamba lyaki ni yula Mwanakondolu. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Wandu wa milima hyogha watetyanga kumhana ghaki na wankosi wa kumlima wogha watayegha unaisa ghao kumbwani hau. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Milyango gha mmbwani hau itewopwa ng'ogha, kwaikiva mghati ghaki kutewela ng'ogha na uhiku. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Utundamilu na ukulu vya wandu wa milima hyogha viteyeghwa kumbwani hau. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ila kwahela kindu chochosi kyeni kujumilwa ng'ogha na Sapanga kiteyingila hamu, wala mundu yeyosi mweni kughola mighalu gha kuhyomelesa au gha ululunganyi ateyingila ng'ogha hamu. Wateyingila hamu ni wala weka wenikuyandikwa kukihitabu kya ukomu kya Mwanakondolu.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Hinu yula mtumikila wa Sapanga wa kundumba akanilangiha lweni lwa masi gha ukomu, masi ghaki yeni kung'anyima handa kiou yakihuma kweni kitamilo kya kinkosi kya Sapanga na Mwanakondolu. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />“Lweni” halu lupitili paghati gha njila ngulunga gha hau mmbwani. Kwa kila upandi wa halu lweni kuwelile na libiki lya ukomu lyeni kulela matungula ndambu ikumi na ivili weka weka, na ungulela kila mwehi, na mahamba gha libiki hali ni mtela gha kuwalamisa wandu wa milima hyogha. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Kutewela ng'ogha na kulapilwa kokosi kangi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Kitamilu kya kiinkosi kya Sapanga na kya Mwanakondolu kitewela kummbwani hau, na watumikila ghaki watemtumikila, <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />wateulola wusu ghaki, na lihina lyaki liteyandikwa kunani gha vibhungi vya wusu ghao. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Uhiku utewela ng'ogha kangi wala watepala ng'ogha mhana wa limbamba wala wa lijuwa, kwaikiva Bambu Sapanga atewapegha mhana na weni watelongosa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Hinu yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akanilongela, “Milando hai ni gha kujumilika na gha chakaka, Bambu Sapanga, uwapegha walota mpumulo ghaki, amyeghili mtumikila ghaki wa kundumba kuwalangiha watumikila ghaki mighalu hila lasima ihumile njenji hinaa.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yesu angulongela, “Ninguhika njenji, kana uhighili yula mweni kukola milando gha ulota yeni kuwela kukihitabu haki.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Nenga Yohana, ndiwa nilolile na kuhyoghanila mighalu hai, na paniyomola kuhyoghanila na kulola nikalitagha pahi gha kuulongolo gha maghulu gha hayu mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga anilangusili mighalu hai nikapala kumyupa. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ila mweni akanilongela, “Ukotoho kughola nagha! Nenga ni mtumikila myako pamonga na walongo ghako walota na wogha wenikuyayitikila malaghilo yenikuwela kukihitabu haki, wenga mumyupi Sapanga.” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Kangi akanilongela, “Ukotoho kuhigha milando gha ulota yenikuwela kukihitabu haki kwaikiva lipindi lya kutimila kwaki liwela pabehi. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Mundu yeyosi mwenikughola mahakata na ayendeleli kughola mahakata, na yeyosi mwenikughola mighalu gha honi ayendeleli kughola na yeyosi mwenikughola mighalu yeni kujumilwa na Sapanga ayendeleli kughola, na yeyosi awelili mundu wa Sapanga na ayendeleli kuwela mundu wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yesu angulonga, “Uyughanili ninguhika njenji pamonga na hupo nitempegha kila mmonga kukovekelana na matendu ghaki.” <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />“Nenga ni ALUFA na OMEGA, wamtumbulo na wa mwihu, nenga ndiwa mweni kutumbula mighalu na kuyayomola.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Wahighilwa wala weni kuwofula nguu zyau, ili wawesi kulekeselwa kulyegha litungula lya libiki lya ukomu na kulekeselwa kuyingila kummbwani hau kupitila milyango ghaki. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ila wala wenikughola mighalu gha honi na wahawi na wangongola na weni kukoma na weni kuyupa ling'omung'omu na wogha wenikupala kulongela uhwangi wateyingila ng'ogha mghati gha mmbwani hau.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Nenga, Yesu, nimyegha mtumikila ghangu wa kundumba awahighilisili mighalu hai kumapinga gha wandu weni kunikwinila. Nenga ni kiwelekwa kya ukolu wa Daudi, hila ndondwa gha yeni kung'anyima malawila!”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga na mdala wa uposu wa Mwanakondolu wangumkema Bambu wangulonga, “Uhiki!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">na kila mundu mweni kuhyoghanila hali na alongi, “Uhiki!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Mweni kuwela na kuyumilila ahiki na kila mweni kupala, na atole masi gha ukomu bila mahipo.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Nenga Yohananinguwalemesa wandu wogha wenikuhyoghanila milando gha ulota gha kihitabu haki, mundu yeyosi pakayongesa kindu chochosi kumighalu hai Sapanga atemuyongesela matovu yenikuyandikwa kukihitabu haki. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Mundu yeyosi pakapungula chochosi kumilando gha ulota gha kihitabu haki Sapanga atemuhumisila mbandi ghaki kulila libiki lya ukomu na kuhula mmbwani wa Sapanga wenikuwela milando ghaki iyandikwa kukihitabu haki.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Hayu mweni kulongela mighalu hai angulonga, “Hina ninguhika njenji.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Na iweli nagha uhiki Bambu Yesu.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Ninguwayupilila mwenga wogha ili umaha wa Bambu Yesu uweli na mwenga. Hina.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>